(4588528, 661998, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like how you seem to have two patterns going on but they are both in the middle. It creates a lot of negative space. The sky is nice I think the photo would look better without some of it though...</td>', 'I like how you seem to have two patterns going on but they are both in the middle. It creates a lot of negative space. The sky is nice I think the photo would look better without some of it though...', '2008-03-26 10:50:06.000000', NULL, 1);
