(4589337, 661684, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this for a couple of reasons.  One, there are a lot of patterns in there so there is a lot to look at.  Also, it is kinda nice to not be looking at a picture of just a texture,but of texture that seems to have a purpose.  On a different level,I couldn''t help but wonder how many of these people are going through the same "pattern" everyday.  Nice shot.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'I like this for a couple of reasons.  One, there are a lot of patterns in there so there is a lot to look at.  Also, it is kinda nice to not be looking at a picture of just a texture,but of texture that seems to have a purpose.  On a different level,I couldn''t help but wonder how many of these people are going through the same "pattern" everyday.  Nice shot.  Hope it does well.', '2008-03-26 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589346, 660404, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is really  beautiful and different.  Unexpectedly nice to see this here.</td>', 'That is really  beautiful and different.  Unexpectedly nice to see this here.', '2008-03-26 15:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589349, 661712, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the tilt hurts it.  Otherwise - nicely done.</td>', 'I think the tilt hurts it.  Otherwise - nicely done.', '2008-03-26 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589353, 662214, 811, '<td valign="top">Way cool.  From across the room, it almost looked 3D.</td>', 'Way cool.  From across the room, it almost looked 3D.', '2008-03-26 15:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589356, 661917, 59029, '<td valign="top">basically a good shot, but the texture in the petals is quite soft.  A nice change from shots with flowers in full bloom, this tight furl.</td>', 'basically a good shot, but the texture in the petals is quite soft.  A nice change from shots with flowers in full bloom, this tight furl.', '2008-03-26 15:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589360, 661907, 59029, '<td valign="top">good clean image but the washy sky throws it off a little.  The centredness works well here, too.</td>', 'good clean image but the washy sky throws it off a little.  The centredness works well here, too.', '2008-03-26 15:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589364, 661873, 59029, '<td valign="top">I like this shot except for the one streetlamp poking its head in from the right.</td>', 'I like this shot except for the one streetlamp poking its head in from the right.', '2008-03-26 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589366, 660096, 26001, '<td valign="top">This has nice details and warm colors. the exposure and lighting are good too.<br/>even though this one shows more details in corks, I prefer the ctf version. more background gives meaning to this arrangement of corks. why would one arrange the corks this way? the relationship between background and foreground stops that shot from being just a shot of "neatly arranged corks". the contrast between brick color and white cork color works very nicely too. even the composition looks much more appealing and balanced in that one.</td>', 'This has nice details and warm colors. the exposure and lighting are good too.even though this one shows more details in corks, I prefer the ctf version. more background gives meaning to this arrangement of corks. why would one arrange the corks this way? the relationship between background and foreground stops that shot from being just a shot of "neatly arranged corks". the contrast between brick color and white cork color works very nicely too. even the composition looks much more appealing and balanced in that one.', '2008-03-26 15:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589367, 661756, 59029, '<td valign="top">may as well put a mirrored skyscraper to good use! nice light and comp.</td>', 'may as well put a mirrored skyscraper to good use! nice light and comp.', '2008-03-26 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589371, 662065, 59029, '<td valign="top">good way to show off the bones of this bridge, light good except that section near the middle.</td>', 'good way to show off the bones of this bridge, light good except that section near the middle.', '2008-03-26 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4589372, 661427, 59029, '<td valign="top">very primal-looking plant, nice textures,</td>', 'very primal-looking plant, nice textures,', '2008-03-26 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
