(4589422, 661840, 59029, '<td valign="top">you do see the orange flower, eventually, but it has too much to compete with focally. Some bokeh and/or a closer crop may have worked.</td>', 'you do see the orange flower, eventually, but it has too much to compete with focally. Some bokeh and/or a closer crop may have worked.', '2008-03-26 16:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
