(4590541, 661094, 79955, '<td valign="top">Patterns galore here. IMO if the row of apartments are your main focus, then I would find the foreground to distracting.If they are not then, I would recommend a tighter crop (less sky) to emphasise the whole host of patterns in your shot.<br/>Personally I would go for the former &amp; focus as much as possible on the row of buildings. 6</td>', 'Patterns galore here. IMO if the row of apartments are your main focus, then I would find the foreground to distracting.If they are not then, I would recommend a tighter crop (less sky) to emphasise the whole host of patterns in your shot.Personally I would go for the former & focus as much as possible on the row of buildings. 6', '2008-03-27 02:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4590544, 661825, 79955, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I find the jagged lines distracting (when viewed on my screen). I may be wrong, but I suspect that compression may have done this to your image.</td>', 'Unfortunately I find the jagged lines distracting (when viewed on my screen). I may be wrong, but I suspect that compression may have done this to your image.', '2008-03-27 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
