(4591296, 661566, 84124, '<td valign="top">I looked all over my house for patterns, and there they were, right in my pantry, kudos to you for finding what I couldn''t!  This is a fantastic macro, not sure if it was intentional, but I like the light dropoff across the image.</td>', 'I looked all over my house for patterns, and there they were, right in my pantry, kudos to you for finding what I couldn''t!  This is a fantastic macro, not sure if it was intentional, but I like the light dropoff across the image.', '2008-03-27 12:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591299, 660120, 90658, '<td valign="top">I bit of a stretch for me, but I see what you are doing.  Interesting use of dof to bring the eyes to the center of the neck.  This is a choice I haven''t seen used much, not sure if others are going to appreciate it.  Oh, back to the challenge.  If you could have taken this shot and showed <u><i><b>only</b></i></u> the neck, I would be more inclined to accept, without question, how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'I bit of a stretch for me, but I see what you are doing.  Interesting use of dof to bring the eyes to the center of the neck.  This is a choice I haven''t seen used much, not sure if others are going to appreciate it.  Oh, back to the challenge.  If you could have taken this shot and showed only the neck, I would be more inclined to accept, without question, how this fits the challenge.', '2008-03-27 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591301, 660304, 84124, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  I would have liked to have seen more depth of field, but regardless, this works well.</td>', 'Nice find!  I would have liked to have seen more depth of field, but regardless, this works well.', '2008-03-27 12:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591306, 660658, 84124, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  This shot will do well, spot on with the challenge criteria.  I''m guessing I''m looking at some modern art or decorative ceiling of some kind.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'Great capture!  This shot will do well, spot on with the challenge criteria.  I''m guessing I''m looking at some modern art or decorative ceiling of some kind.  Pretty cool.', '2008-03-27 12:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591307, 662208, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  You have lost part of the dynamic of this with the shadow on the left.  It almost looks like you are not centered.  There is a weensy bit shell missing on the right, but we can''t tell if it is the same on the left, due to the shadows.  Leave the vertical cropping alone.  I like the aspect of these lines going into infinity at the top.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  You have lost part of the dynamic of this with the shadow on the left.  It almost looks like you are not centered.  There is a weensy bit shell missing on the right, but we can''t tell if it is the same on the left, due to the shadows.  Leave the vertical cropping alone.  I like the aspect of these lines going into infinity at the top.', '2008-03-27 12:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591309, 661249, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very nice eye, seeing the lines of water as well as the tiles..</td>', 'Very nice eye, seeing the lines of water as well as the tiles..', '2008-03-27 12:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591310, 662183, 84124, '<td valign="top">Great concentric pattern effect!  No doubt this will do well.</td>', 'Great concentric pattern effect!  No doubt this will do well.', '2008-03-27 12:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591316, 660656, 84124, '<td valign="top">As we say here in the great northeast, "wicked pissah"!  Cool effect, an extra point for creativity.  Love the balance of color across the image.</td>', 'As we say here in the great northeast, "wicked pissah"!  Cool effect, an extra point for creativity.  Love the balance of color across the image.', '2008-03-27 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591320, 662087, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the pattern <i>challenge</i> is actually diminished by the texture of the rust.  Not that it diminishes this shot.  I really, really, really like what you have done here.  The angle from left to right, top to bottom, is different.  Most people would have gone the other way, or taken this on the horizontal.  The rust does add visual interst and I think that overall this is wonderful photography.</td>', 'I think the pattern challenge is actually diminished by the texture of the rust.  Not that it diminishes this shot.  I really, really, really like what you have done here.  The angle from left to right, top to bottom, is different.  Most people would have gone the other way, or taken this on the horizontal.  The rust does add visual interst and I think that overall this is wonderful photography.', '2008-03-27 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591321, 660182, 90658, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2008-03-27 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
