(4591329, 661011, 84124, '<td valign="top">Silver straws?  Very cool!  I''m saying that a lot in this challenge.  well done.</td>', 'Silver straws?  Very cool!  I''m saying that a lot in this challenge.  well done.', '2008-03-27 12:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591330, 660667, 90658, '<td valign="top">So many patterns, so little time.  I think my biggest problem is coloring, or lack thereof.  I am not a photographer so I really can''t explain what is missing, it is probably in the editing.  Was this desaturated?  Was it b&amp;w?  Send this to the Critique Club and see if they have any suggestions.</td>', 'So many patterns, so little time.  I think my biggest problem is coloring, or lack thereof.  I am not a photographer so I really can''t explain what is missing, it is probably in the editing.  Was this desaturated?  Was it b&w?  Send this to the Critique Club and see if they have any suggestions.', '2008-03-27 12:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591333, 660877, 90658, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  I would have totally missed that.</td>', 'Good eye!  I would have totally missed that.', '2008-03-27 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591336, 660363, 84124, '<td valign="top">Another great challenge shot.  Wonderful creativity and lighting.  I''m just shaking my head at all the great shots in this challenge, this being one of them.</td>', 'Another great challenge shot.  Wonderful creativity and lighting.  I''m just shaking my head at all the great shots in this challenge, this being one of them.', '2008-03-27 12:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591340, 660547, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmmm!  There is so much, or was so much going on here.  The bricks of building have a distinct pattern, but they are now all blurred together, the windows on the left have a pattern, but the white is so blown out you can''t see it.  I almost feel as if you are sacrificing elements that could make this stunning to force our eyes to the ceiling...which is oof to my eyes.</td>', 'Hmmm!  There is so much, or was so much going on here.  The bricks of building have a distinct pattern, but they are now all blurred together, the windows on the left have a pattern, but the white is so blown out you can''t see it.  I almost feel as if you are sacrificing elements that could make this stunning to force our eyes to the ceiling...which is oof to my eyes.', '2008-03-27 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591343, 661985, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Is the glass blue or is this a background?  I only ask because it seems too dark to me.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Is the glass blue or is this a background?  I only ask because it seems too dark to me.', '2008-03-27 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591345, 662183, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I sort of like this, even though I generally don''t go for things like this.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I sort of like this, even though I generally don''t go for things like this.', '2008-03-27 12:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591350, 660634, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the shadows actually elongate and accentuate the patterns on the stairs.  It adds a different dimension.</td>', 'I like the fact that the shadows actually elongate and accentuate the patterns on the stairs.  It adds a different dimension.', '2008-03-27 12:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591355, 661113, 90658, '<td valign="top">Other than the flying and they are all seagulls, I don''t find a pattern here.  Sorry.  I do like the coloring of the sky and the silhouette of the birds.</td>', 'Other than the flying and they are all seagulls, I don''t find a pattern here.  Sorry.  I do like the coloring of the sky and the silhouette of the birds.', '2008-03-27 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591358, 662081, 90658, '<td valign="top">I actually find the colors to be too subtle.  I would be willing to bet that people will mention the wrinkles and folds in the fabric.  I like it, they add a dimension to the shot.  If they weren''t there, you''d have a shot of a placemat.</td>', 'I actually find the colors to be too subtle.  I would be willing to bet that people will mention the wrinkles and folds in the fabric.  I like it, they add a dimension to the shot.  If they weren''t there, you''d have a shot of a placemat.', '2008-03-27 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591361, 660688, 90658, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the white background.  It makes everything too harsh.</td>', 'Don''t like the white background.  It makes everything too harsh.', '2008-03-27 12:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591362, 662108, 84124, '<td valign="top">Beautiful natural pattern and great lighting.  Would like to have seen a greater depth of field.</td>', 'Beautiful natural pattern and great lighting.  Would like to have seen a greater depth of field.', '2008-03-27 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591366, 660752, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very simple pattern, but quite pleasing.  I like that the shadow is what I see first, and then the same pattern in the railings (which makes sense).  My point is, by seeing the shadow first, there is a sense of peace about this shot.  I feel at ease when I see it.</td>', 'Very simple pattern, but quite pleasing.  I like that the shadow is what I see first, and then the same pattern in the railings (which makes sense).  My point is, by seeing the shadow first, there is a sense of peace about this shot.  I feel at ease when I see it.', '2008-03-27 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591370, 662216, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice eye to see that in the clouds in the first place, nice job catching it as well.</td>', 'Nice eye to see that in the clouds in the first place, nice job catching it as well.', '2008-03-27 12:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591376, 661602, 90658, '<td valign="top">Several patterns all working together in harmony.  This is not something I would purchase, but it is something that I would spend some time admiring.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Several patterns all working together in harmony.  This is not something I would purchase, but it is something that I would spend some time admiring.  Nicely done.', '2008-03-27 12:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591381, 662260, 84124, '<td valign="top">You definitely had a really good idea here but the lighting hurts the image.  Perhaps turning off  the flash and give it a second or two exposure.</td>', 'You definitely had a really good idea here but the lighting hurts the image.  Perhaps turning off  the flash and give it a second or two exposure.', '2008-03-27 12:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591388, 661965, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I know your intent was the rooftop, but there are obviously patterns below the roof as well.  I think changing the angle just slightly to remove the eaves in the upper left, and bring the weather vane on the left to the top, would bring in some more visiual interest.  We would still the rooftop, but there would be more.</td>', 'Nice job!  I know your intent was the rooftop, but there are obviously patterns below the roof as well.  I think changing the angle just slightly to remove the eaves in the upper left, and bring the weather vane on the left to the top, would bring in some more visiual interest.  We would still the rooftop, but there would be more.', '2008-03-27 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591393, 662119, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting to look at.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is quite interesting to look at.  Thank you.', '2008-03-27 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591396, 660752, 84124, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot!  The shadow detracts from the pattern, but everything else is spot on.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot!  The shadow detracts from the pattern, but everything else is spot on.', '2008-03-27 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591400, 661543, 90658, '<td valign="top">The corner is almost too flat.  It is difficulet to see the angle.  Shading would have helped, or a different angle of shot.</td>', 'The corner is almost too flat.  It is difficulet to see the angle.  Shading would have helped, or a different angle of shot.', '2008-03-27 12:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
