(4591407, 661566, 90658, '<td valign="top">Ramen noodles before cooking.  So simple, so tasty!  I think there is a humor here that others might miss.  I, however, am grinning ear to ear and now I am hungry.</td>', 'Ramen noodles before cooking.  So simple, so tasty!  I think there is a humor here that others might miss.  I, however, am grinning ear to ear and now I am hungry.', '2008-03-27 12:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591409, 660724, 90658, '<td valign="top">You might think I''m crazy here, but the symmetry of the shell almost dictates a symmetry of shot.  You''ve got the cropping right, but the shell is placed asymmetrically within it.  A slight twist to the right and you''ve got a perfect star, a perfect shell, perfect coloring and perfect cropping.</td>', 'You might think I''m crazy here, but the symmetry of the shell almost dictates a symmetry of shot.  You''ve got the cropping right, but the shell is placed asymmetrically within it.  A slight twist to the right and you''ve got a perfect star, a perfect shell, perfect coloring and perfect cropping.', '2008-03-27 12:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591411, 662276, 90658, '<td valign="top">Adding the knife, not only added interest, but the colors of the reflection are intensified.</td>', 'Adding the knife, not only added interest, but the colors of the reflection are intensified.', '2008-03-27 12:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591414, 660183, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  I would suggest sepia instead of b&amp;w.  Too me, sepia adds a dimension of "oldness" or "antiqueness."</td>', 'I like this alot.  I would suggest sepia instead of b&w.  Too me, sepia adds a dimension of "oldness" or "antiqueness."', '2008-03-27 12:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
