(4591416, 661947, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Well done.', '2008-03-27 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591421, 662083, 90658, '<td valign="top">Other than stacking, I don''t see a discernable pattern here.  Unless it is the ridges along the sides of the stacks, and if that is the case, then this shot is too dark.  Sorry.</td>', 'Other than stacking, I don''t see a discernable pattern here.  Unless it is the ridges along the sides of the stacks, and if that is the case, then this shot is too dark.  Sorry.', '2008-03-27 13:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591423, 661898, 90658, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide it the houses behind the spindles are adding anything to this shot.  I would play with dof to see the differences.  You might end up losing the stark beauty of the railings.</td>', 'I can''t decide it the houses behind the spindles are adding anything to this shot.  I would play with dof to see the differences.  You might end up losing the stark beauty of the railings.', '2008-03-27 13:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591424, 661713, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I would like to see the dof adjusted so that the foreground is in focus.</td>', 'This is nice.  I would like to see the dof adjusted so that the foreground is in focus.', '2008-03-27 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591426, 661945, 90658, '<td valign="top">Who would''ve thought that a cheese grater could be pretty?!</td>', 'Who would''ve thought that a cheese grater could be pretty?!', '2008-03-27 13:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591434, 661920, 90658, '<td valign="top">There is a quality to this shot that I find very engaging and hypnotic.  Well done.</td>', 'There is a quality to this shot that I find very engaging and hypnotic.  Well done.', '2008-03-27 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591438, 660129, 90658, '<td valign="top">Simple &amp; elegant.</td>', 'Simple & elegant.', '2008-03-27 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591440, 661422, 83313, '<td valign="top">The reflected image is so broken up that I can''t even guess at what it is that relates to the title. The image as a whole is ok, but it does not seem to have much punch to it. A little noise reduction and sharpening might help, but I am not sure.</td>', 'The reflected image is so broken up that I can''t even guess at what it is that relates to the title. The image as a whole is ok, but it does not seem to have much punch to it. A little noise reduction and sharpening might help, but I am not sure.', '2008-03-27 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591441, 662066, 90658, '<td valign="top">The colors are surprising brilliant, you wouldn''t expect that with blues and golds.  There is something missing for me.  Send this to the Critque Club or one of the forums, they could probably figure it out better than I can.</td>', 'The colors are surprising brilliant, you wouldn''t expect that with blues and golds.  There is something missing for me.  Send this to the Critque Club or one of the forums, they could probably figure it out better than I can.', '2008-03-27 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591444, 660681, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!</td>', 'This is stunning!', '2008-03-27 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591445, 661656, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good, though it does not have the kind of impact I have seen in some similar shots. Perhaps it is the lighting, or it may be just a touch oversharpened, though I am not really sure.</td>', 'This is pretty good, though it does not have the kind of impact I have seen in some similar shots. Perhaps it is the lighting, or it may be just a touch oversharpened, though I am not really sure.', '2008-03-27 13:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591446, 661382, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing.</td>', 'Very intriguing.', '2008-03-27 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591451, 662067, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and colors here, though the shallow DOF and angle are keeping me from knowing what part of the shoe this is. I would not have known it was a shoe if not for the title.</td>', 'Nice texture and colors here, though the shallow DOF and angle are keeping me from knowing what part of the shoe this is. I would not have known it was a shoe if not for the title.', '2008-03-27 13:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591454, 661916, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like looking at this.  You''ve got so many patterns and they all work together.  The vertical beams, the window frames, the colors behind the windows.  Then you have the repetition of the reflection.  Well done.</td>', 'I like looking at this.  You''ve got so many patterns and they all work together.  The vertical beams, the window frames, the colors behind the windows.  Then you have the repetition of the reflection.  Well done.', '2008-03-27 13:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591457, 662119, 83313, '<td valign="top">You must have a cross pattern filter in order to do this within editing rules. I like it. Only minor complaint is the shadows seem a little strong and they complicate a detailed pattern a bit too much.</td>', 'You must have a cross pattern filter in order to do this within editing rules. I like it. Only minor complaint is the shadows seem a little strong and they complicate a detailed pattern a bit too much.', '2008-03-27 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591459, 662177, 91644, '<td valign="top">oh thats great...haha :)</td>', 'oh thats great...haha :)', '2008-03-27 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591460, 661354, 86799, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.</td>', 'Cool idea.', '2008-03-27 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591466, 661856, 86799, '<td valign="top">or no pattern at all?  Nice pic, but more chaos and chance than pattern, IMO.</td>', 'or no pattern at all?  Nice pic, but more chaos and chance than pattern, IMO.', '2008-03-27 13:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591468, 662259, 90658, '<td valign="top">I am going to be really nit-picky here.  You are missing the fourth pattern.  You''ve got the first three:  layout, quarters, face-up.  The fourth would be the way the faces lay.  If every single quarter were lined up exactly so that the faces were exactly the same, you would have had it.  They don''t all need to be facing right, they could be to the top or the bottom, just so that every coin was exactly the same as every other one.  Then, you could really play up the title by having one be different.  Either a different coin, face-down or looking a different direction.  Just an observation.</td>', 'I am going to be really nit-picky here.  You are missing the fourth pattern.  You''ve got the first three:  layout, quarters, face-up.  The fourth would be the way the faces lay.  If every single quarter were lined up exactly so that the faces were exactly the same, you would have had it.  They don''t all need to be facing right, they could be to the top or the bottom, just so that every coin was exactly the same as every other one.  Then, you could really play up the title by having one be different.  Either a different coin, face-down or looking a different direction.  Just an observation.', '2008-03-27 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591473, 662071, 90658, '<td valign="top">Am I being too literal of your abstract?  I get the play on words between exact and eggsact, but are you also playing on the definition?  I do not know enough about what is implied to make a really good decision here.  If you are going for an EXACT pattern, oops!  If you were playing with things, you have not given enough information to communicate that, imo.</td>', 'Am I being too literal of your abstract?  I get the play on words between exact and eggsact, but are you also playing on the definition?  I do not know enough about what is implied to make a really good decision here.  If you are going for an EXACT pattern, oops!  If you were playing with things, you have not given enough information to communicate that, imo.', '2008-03-27 13:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591474, 661985, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent, though different lighting and PP adjustments may have been able to coax a little more "wow" out of the glass.</td>', 'Pretty decent, though different lighting and PP adjustments may have been able to coax a little more "wow" out of the glass.', '2008-03-27 13:33:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4591476, 660096, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nit-picky Nellie here.  You''ve got the chevron pattern, you even have ahint of pattern from the bricks, but you missed one.  The names of the wineries.  They are right there on the corks.  Why not set a pattern with those as well?  As much as you can.</td>', 'Nit-picky Nellie here.  You''ve got the chevron pattern, you even have ahint of pattern from the bricks, but you missed one.  The names of the wineries.  They are right there on the corks.  Why not set a pattern with those as well?  As much as you can.', '2008-03-27 13:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591482, 662259, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to have lost some of the fine detail of the coins in the resize to 640 pixels. I think in a large size this would have much more impact.</td>', 'Seems to have lost some of the fine detail of the coins in the resize to 640 pixels. I think in a large size this would have much more impact.', '2008-03-27 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591487, 661907, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well, I found all six patterns.  I wonder how many people actually did.  Honestly, depending on your intrepretation of a pattern, there are more than 6 here.</td>', 'Well, I found all six patterns.  I wonder how many people actually did.  Honestly, depending on your intrepretation of a pattern, there are more than 6 here.', '2008-03-27 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591490, 661812, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept.</td>', 'Very interesting concept.', '2008-03-27 13:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591496, 661598, 83313, '<td valign="top">I missed the pattern when I was viewing the thumbnails. Now I see it is the ripples in the water that is the pattern here. Very nice. I like the composition. You got all the important elements in here with out centering it. I suspect you may get dinged a little because, though the pattern is there, it is not the main subject. That may be what is happening to my own entry as well.</td>', 'I missed the pattern when I was viewing the thumbnails. Now I see it is the ripples in the water that is the pattern here. Very nice. I like the composition. You got all the important elements in here with out centering it. I suspect you may get dinged a little because, though the pattern is there, it is not the main subject. That may be what is happening to my own entry as well.', '2008-03-27 13:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591497, 662063, 90658, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.', '2008-03-27 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591499, 661646, 90658, '<td valign="top">Are these bolts of fabric?  They are quite fun.</td>', 'Are these bolts of fabric?  They are quite fun.', '2008-03-27 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591500, 662207, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not caring for the negative image, I''m afraid. It just comes off on me as harsh.</td>', 'I''m not caring for the negative image, I''m afraid. It just comes off on me as harsh.', '2008-03-27 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591503, 661410, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very good. My only critique is that the point the comp is leading me toward is a little bit too much to the left for my preference.</td>', 'Very good. My only critique is that the point the comp is leading me toward is a little bit too much to the left for my preference.', '2008-03-27 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591505, 661919, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The sepia tone works well for the subject. Lots of nice texture here.</td>', 'I really like this one. The sepia tone works well for the subject. Lots of nice texture here.', '2008-03-27 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591511, 660604, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. Fine lines and great detail. I may have done the comp so as to have it angled differently and off toward a corner a touch, but that a personal pref.</td>', 'Nice. Fine lines and great detail. I may have done the comp so as to have it angled differently and off toward a corner a touch, but that a personal pref.', '2008-03-27 13:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591520, 661885, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit of compression artifacts showing, especially toward the top of the frame around the masts. You file size is 99k, you could have used less compression and eliminated the artifacts. Always go with the maximum size you can use and still fit into the rules. That''s 150k in this case.</td>', 'A bit of compression artifacts showing, especially toward the top of the frame around the masts. You file size is 99k, you could have used less compression and eliminated the artifacts. Always go with the maximum size you can use and still fit into the rules. That''s 150k in this case.', '2008-03-27 13:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591527, 662264, 83313, '<td valign="top">This guy is cool looking. A little better DOF would be nice, but that''s a limitation where you probably already did the best you could with it.</td>', 'This guy is cool looking. A little better DOF would be nice, but that''s a limitation where you probably already did the best you could with it.', '2008-03-27 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591537, 661747, 79357, '<td valign="top">These hand paintings are gorgeous. A step closer cropping out the pink and purple persons would have been even better.</td>', 'These hand paintings are gorgeous. A step closer cropping out the pink and purple persons would have been even better.', '2008-03-27 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591542, 662072, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though the white straw in the middle does not look natural. The middle is just too white and it looks like it was pasted there or enhanced in post processing. My apologies if I am wrong.</td>', 'Nice, though the white straw in the middle does not look natural. The middle is just too white and it looks like it was pasted there or enhanced in post processing. My apologies if I am wrong.', '2008-03-27 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591554, 660769, 79357, '<td valign="top">Nice abstraction! Cropping out the left edge would be even better.</td>', 'Nice abstraction! Cropping out the left edge would be even better.', '2008-03-27 13:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591563, 661587, 79357, '<td valign="top">Looks like a piece of raw beef, haha!</td>', 'Looks like a piece of raw beef, haha!', '2008-03-27 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591564, 660880, 83313, '<td valign="top">The long focal length really did well for this scene. It does not lead my eye quite as well as it should though. Seems too heavy toward the bottom. Perhaps a different crop...</td>', 'The long focal length really did well for this scene. It does not lead my eye quite as well as it should though. Seems too heavy toward the bottom. Perhaps a different crop...', '2008-03-27 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591590, 662081, 5364, '<td valign="top">This might have worked better if you could have increased the contrast.</td>', 'This might have worked better if you could have increased the contrast.', '2008-03-27 14:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591595, 661960, 83313, '<td valign="top">No vote from me on this one, since I saw it come up on my Flickr home page, so I know whose it is. I may need to consider removing the DPC members from my Flickr contacts. <br/> <br/>Very good clarity, and of course, a sunset makes anything awesome. Nice stuff.</td>', 'No vote from me on this one, since I saw it come up on my Flickr home page, so I know whose it is. I may need to consider removing the DPC members from my Flickr contacts.  Very good clarity, and of course, a sunset makes anything awesome. Nice stuff.', '2008-03-27 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591596, 661745, 79357, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, unfortunately no hit on the theme Pattern.</td>', 'Awesome photo, unfortunately no hit on the theme Pattern.', '2008-03-27 14:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591598, 661598, 79357, '<td valign="top">Nice mood! It would have fit better on the theme Pattern if you took a photo of the nice water reflections (or just cropped this one)</td>', 'Nice mood! It would have fit better on the theme Pattern if you took a photo of the nice water reflections (or just cropped this one)', '2008-03-27 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591600, 660634, 79357, '<td valign="top">Great shadows! I would have cropped out the lamp.</td>', 'Great shadows! I would have cropped out the lamp.', '2008-03-27 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591601, 661542, 79357, '<td valign="top">I like this one! It''s a little grainy.</td>', 'I like this one! It''s a little grainy.', '2008-03-27 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591607, 662050, 79357, '<td valign="top">its lacking a little sharpness</td>', 'its lacking a little sharpness', '2008-03-27 14:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591609, 661713, 79357, '<td valign="top">I believe it would have been even better in landscape crop (only the lamps)</td>', 'I believe it would have been even better in landscape crop (only the lamps)', '2008-03-27 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591610, 660724, 79357, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the black would have made this a winner</td>', 'Cropping out the black would have made this a winner', '2008-03-27 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591612, 662202, 79357, '<td valign="top">An even tighter cropping would have improved this one</td>', 'An even tighter cropping would have improved this one', '2008-03-27 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591617, 660076, 79357, '<td valign="top">I like the vignetting, it adds mood</td>', 'I like the vignetting, it adds mood', '2008-03-27 14:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591625, 660880, 79357, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would look like in 1 bit black and white without grayscales</td>', 'I wonder what this would look like in 1 bit black and white without grayscales', '2008-03-27 14:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591627, 661774, 79357, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped away the sky to the right</td>', 'I would have cropped away the sky to the right', '2008-03-27 14:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591631, 662252, 79357, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Try correcting the perspective with Transform or Lens correction in Photoshop.</td>', 'Nice one! Try correcting the perspective with Transform or Lens correction in Photoshop.', '2008-03-27 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591633, 661773, 79357, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the odd perspective makes it confusing to look at</td>', 'Nice picture, but the odd perspective makes it confusing to look at', '2008-03-27 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591672, 661936, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is the exact fence I saw in Manchester NH this weekend around their town green... I like the flow you created with the DOF. Nice work.</td>', 'This is the exact fence I saw in Manchester NH this weekend around their town green... I like the flow you created with the DOF. Nice work.', '2008-03-27 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591702, 660127, 91298, '<td valign="top">z</td>', 'z', '2008-03-27 15:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591704, 660120, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the Pov. However, the focus area seems a bit soft.</td>', 'I like the idea and the Pov. However, the focus area seems a bit soft.', '2008-03-27 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591707, 662053, 33672, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. More contrast might give this more pop.</td>', 'Cool idea. More contrast might give this more pop.', '2008-03-27 15:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591709, 660129, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. great example of theme.</td>', 'Nice lighting. great example of theme.', '2008-03-27 15:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591737, 661815, 80458, '<td valign="top">Very very nice photo. Would''ve liked you to apply the rule of thirds for the lamp positioning. I think it''s a little too far in the lower left. Still giving you a high score though. Great patterns as well.</td>', 'Very very nice photo. Would''ve liked you to apply the rule of thirds for the lamp positioning. I think it''s a little too far in the lower left. Still giving you a high score though. Great patterns as well.', '2008-03-27 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591738, 660404, 80458, '<td valign="top">great silhouette. Really nice patterns in the tower itself and the power is repeated in the depth of the shot.</td>', 'great silhouette. Really nice patterns in the tower itself and the power is repeated in the depth of the shot.', '2008-03-27 15:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591739, 662108, 80458, '<td valign="top">nice macro. Great idea for this challenge.</td>', 'nice macro. Great idea for this challenge.', '2008-03-27 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591740, 659828, 80458, '<td valign="top">call me crazy, but i''m not seeing much of a pattern here. It''s a nice shot though.</td>', 'call me crazy, but i''m not seeing much of a pattern here. It''s a nice shot though.', '2008-03-27 15:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591744, 661639, 84124, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Lots of design here to engage the viewer, the vanishing point in the upper right is nicely broken up by the two people.  I don''t have any nitpicks on this, this is a great shot.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Lots of design here to engage the viewer, the vanishing point in the upper right is nicely broken up by the two people.  I don''t have any nitpicks on this, this is a great shot.', '2008-03-27 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591745, 662083, 80458, '<td valign="top">nice dof, but I think it would be better if the money wasnt so centered in your shot. It''s also underexposed for me. I think it could be more pattern-like by making the stacks the same size.</td>', 'nice dof, but I think it would be better if the money wasnt so centered in your shot. It''s also underexposed for me. I think it could be more pattern-like by making the stacks the same size.', '2008-03-27 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591756, 662255, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity is so blurry</td>', 'It''s a pity is so blurry', '2008-03-27 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591760, 662202, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the ripples in the sand, but I don''t think you needed to include the stream in the background.</td>', 'I like the ripples in the sand, but I don''t think you needed to include the stream in the background.', '2008-03-27 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591762, 661531, 5364, '<td valign="top">This could be good, but why so small?</td>', 'This could be good, but why so small?', '2008-03-27 15:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591777, 661007, 88533, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. The patterns are rather chaotic, I like that. There is some loss of detail, possibly intentional or due to resizing. Personally I would have preferred a crystal sharp shot of this.  - 7</td>', 'Interesting take. The patterns are rather chaotic, I like that. There is some loss of detail, possibly intentional or due to resizing. Personally I would have preferred a crystal sharp shot of this.  - 7', '2008-03-27 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591778, 662177, 88533, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture but I don''t see much of a pattern here.  -6</td>', 'A very nice capture but I don''t see much of a pattern here.  -6', '2008-03-27 15:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591780, 660363, 88533, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it looks more like a graphic rather than a photograph -6</td>', 'I like it, but it looks more like a graphic rather than a photograph -6', '2008-03-27 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591787, 661587, 88533, '<td valign="top">The cropping doesn''t work for me. A close-up would have been more interesting. Also, this is rather small in size, I would recommend making use of the max. size for the contest, i.e. 640 px in this case. -3</td>', 'The cropping doesn''t work for me. A close-up would have been more interesting. Also, this is rather small in size, I would recommend making use of the max. size for the contest, i.e. 640 px in this case. -3', '2008-03-27 15:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591792, 661385, 88533, '<td valign="top">IMO this would have been more interesting with either the entire shot in focus, or focus on the top part with the bottom parts blurred out. -4</td>', 'IMO this would have been more interesting with either the entire shot in focus, or focus on the top part with the bottom parts blurred out. -4', '2008-03-27 15:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591796, 662121, 88533, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I would have preferred the entire shot to be in focus, the blurred out top part doesn''t work for me.  -5</td>', 'Interesting, I would have preferred the entire shot to be in focus, the blurred out top part doesn''t work for me.  -5', '2008-03-27 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591803, 662267, 88533, '<td valign="top">Technically a good photograph, but the subject doesn''t wow me. Maybe it''s the bright background, the red and white colors steal attention from the dark green subject. -6</td>', 'Technically a good photograph, but the subject doesn''t wow me. Maybe it''s the bright background, the red and white colors steal attention from the dark green subject. -6', '2008-03-27 16:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591807, 661311, 88533, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more detail in this shot but I''ll assume this is due to resizing. The choice of subject and technical aspects are excellent. -8</td>', 'I would have liked to see more detail in this shot but I''ll assume this is due to resizing. The choice of subject and technical aspects are excellent. -8', '2008-03-27 16:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591809, 662090, 5364, '<td valign="top">I feel the brightness in the background rather distracts.</td>', 'I feel the brightness in the background rather distracts.', '2008-03-27 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591818, 660809, 88533, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, excellent exposure (love the blurred blades). A little short on actual patterns, but I get it -7</td>', 'Nice composition, excellent exposure (love the blurred blades). A little short on actual patterns, but I get it -7', '2008-03-27 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591819, 661587, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think your photo could have more impact if it were larger.  If you are unsure about sizing, check the forums on post processing issues.</td>', 'I think your photo could have more impact if it were larger.  If you are unsure about sizing, check the forums on post processing issues.', '2008-03-27 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591820, 662121, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think your selective focus may hurt you in this picture.  Being a pattern challenge, I think I would like to see more sharpness throughout the picture.</td>', 'I think your selective focus may hurt you in this picture.  Being a pattern challenge, I think I would like to see more sharpness throughout the picture.', '2008-03-27 16:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
