(4591944, 661818, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this, and the almost minimalistic feeling.  I also like that the trees are only on one side -- that sets up quite a balance with the paths.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this, and the almost minimalistic feeling.  I also like that the trees are only on one side -- that sets up quite a balance with the paths.', '2008-03-27 17:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591948, 660129, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that you just keep looking at, and turning your heads different ways to "figure it out."  Ultimately, you can''t figure it out and just say "cool."  I don''t like the slightest pink cast it has, but also figure that could be my monitor, because it is *slight*.  Very nicely done</td>', 'This is one of those shots that you just keep looking at, and turning your heads different ways to "figure it out."  Ultimately, you can''t figure it out and just say "cool."  I don''t like the slightest pink cast it has, but also figure that could be my monitor, because it is *slight*.  Very nicely done', '2008-03-27 17:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591952, 661998, 811, '<td valign="top">This one is a touch too dark, BUT I like it because it has the pattern of all the crosses, as well as a more subtle pattern -- the pattern of the cycle of life.  Or maybe you just thought it was a cool sky and I''m reading too much into it. :)  Still a neat shot.</td>', 'This one is a touch too dark, BUT I like it because it has the pattern of all the crosses, as well as a more subtle pattern -- the pattern of the cycle of life.  Or maybe you just thought it was a cool sky and I''m reading too much into it. :)  Still a neat shot.', '2008-03-27 17:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
