(4591978, 662255, 811, '<td valign="top">I would say a sharper focus would be good, but if this were my picture it would look just like this.  The out of focus would be caused by me running as fast as i could in the opposite direction.  On second though, perhaps I would be backing up slowly.  Nevertheless, I would be getting away from there -- I don''t like snakes.  <br/> <br/>Interesting contrast between the skin and the ground though.</td>', 'I would say a sharper focus would be good, but if this were my picture it would look just like this.  The out of focus would be caused by me running as fast as i could in the opposite direction.  On second though, perhaps I would be backing up slowly.  Nevertheless, I would be getting away from there -- I don''t like snakes.   Interesting contrast between the skin and the ground though.', '2008-03-27 17:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
