(4592214, 662063, 83080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful interpretation, colors and composition with the lines/curve you created.  It might add some polish (to be picky) if these all had the interior petal quality of the 2nd &amp; 3rd from the left and I might have plucked off the scarred petals.  Still, you''ve made a very effective shot overall.</td>', 'Beautiful interpretation, colors and composition with the lines/curve you created.  It might add some polish (to be picky) if these all had the interior petal quality of the 2nd & 3rd from the left and I might have plucked off the scarred petals.  Still, you''ve made a very effective shot overall.', '2008-03-27 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592238, 660328, 83080, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures and colors you''ve created here.  I might hve opted to leave out the bottom with a 3x4 crop as the bottom section doesn''t add much for me.  You could do more of these fun shots for the March Macro side-challenge (if you haven''t already).  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the textures and colors you''ve created here.  I might hve opted to leave out the bottom with a 3x4 crop as the bottom section doesn''t add much for me.  You could do more of these fun shots for the March Macro side-challenge (if you haven''t already).  Nice job.', '2008-03-27 19:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
