(4592314, 661546, 83313, '<td valign="top">A title written with a southern drawl, gotta like it. Pretty decent image, it''s not a "wow" shot, but I think you did a good job on it.</td>', 'A title written with a southern drawl, gotta like it. Pretty decent image, it''s not a "wow" shot, but I think you did a good job on it.', '2008-03-27 20:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592316, 661904, 75642, '<td valign="top">I love this</td>', 'I love this', '2008-03-27 20:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592317, 661993, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have to admit I might have overlooked the light  patterns if not for your title. Pretty good color, exposure and details showing, but the composition of the scene is not really drawing me in.</td>', 'I have to admit I might have overlooked the light  patterns if not for your title. Pretty good color, exposure and details showing, but the composition of the scene is not really drawing me in.', '2008-03-27 20:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592319, 662103, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup. That''s a brick pattern all right. Not really much I can say about this one. It''s pretty basic I''m afraid. Meets the challenge, good exposure and sharp, but not anything about it to really excite me.</td>', 'Yup. That''s a brick pattern all right. Not really much I can say about this one. It''s pretty basic I''m afraid. Meets the challenge, good exposure and sharp, but not anything about it to really excite me.', '2008-03-27 20:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592330, 661961, 83313, '<td valign="top">it''s good, but does not hit the high note for some reason. I think there is a lack of sharpness and detail that my eye is trying to find. Hope that does not sound too vague.</td>', 'it''s good, but does not hit the high note for some reason. I think there is a lack of sharpness and detail that my eye is trying to find. Hope that does not sound too vague.', '2008-03-27 20:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592331, 660349, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think my house is the one on the left. I think a closer view of the tiles may have had more impact, if you could have gotten closer.</td>', 'I think my house is the one on the left. I think a closer view of the tiles may have had more impact, if you could have gotten closer.', '2008-03-27 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592337, 662252, 83313, '<td valign="top">The pattern is great and the blue reflections are nice and smooth. The whole tone of the image seems a little washed out, however. I''ll bet some curves adjustments could really make this one pop. There''s also a bit of visible tilt that could be easily adjusted in PP.</td>', 'The pattern is great and the blue reflections are nice and smooth. The whole tone of the image seems a little washed out, however. I''ll bet some curves adjustments could really make this one pop. There''s also a bit of visible tilt that could be easily adjusted in PP.', '2008-03-27 20:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592342, 660363, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking. What are they? It''s hard to tell, but I really like it.</td>', 'Very nice looking. What are they? It''s hard to tell, but I really like it.', '2008-03-27 20:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592349, 662267, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grass flipped upside down? maybe a fan blowing at this? Slightly abstract here.</td>', 'Grass flipped upside down? maybe a fan blowing at this? Slightly abstract here.', '2008-03-27 20:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592353, 661647, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pretty good shot of something ordinary. The row of lamps guides me right to the sunset.</td>', 'A pretty good shot of something ordinary. The row of lamps guides me right to the sunset.', '2008-03-27 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592356, 661818, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat looking. Well exposed, which is tough to do with snow.</td>', 'Neat looking. Well exposed, which is tough to do with snow.', '2008-03-27 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592367, 661611, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is really a pattern, since these things grow where the seeds randomly fall. I suppose it is a pattern by some definitions, though. I do like it a lot. Composition and DOF work great here.</td>', 'Not sure if this is really a pattern, since these things grow where the seeds randomly fall. I suppose it is a pattern by some definitions, though. I do like it a lot. Composition and DOF work great here.', '2008-03-27 20:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592372, 662247, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a gas hose perhaps? Really bold and lots of detail in this. I like seeing unique views of everyday objects. Good work on this one.</td>', 'Looks like a gas hose perhaps? Really bold and lots of detail in this. I like seeing unique views of everyday objects. Good work on this one.', '2008-03-27 20:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592373, 662208, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, though I think the color and texture of the shell coulg perhaps be brought out a little more, both by PP adjustments and getting in for a closer macro view.</td>', 'Pretty good, though I think the color and texture of the shell coulg perhaps be brought out a little more, both by PP adjustments and getting in for a closer macro view.', '2008-03-27 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592375, 661898, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very thoughtful and effective composition.  I love the lines and the way you frames this shot.</td>', 'Very thoughtful and effective composition.  I love the lines and the way you frames this shot.', '2008-03-27 20:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592379, 662214, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like what you tried to capture here. I don''t care for the washed out highlights, though that may have been intentional on your part.</td>', 'I like what you tried to capture here. I don''t care for the washed out highlights, though that may have been intentional on your part.', '2008-03-27 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592387, 660667, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is pretty darn good. Perhaps it could use a touch more sharpness or contrast to increase the impact of the hard angles.</td>', 'This is pretty darn good. Perhaps it could use a touch more sharpness or contrast to increase the impact of the hard angles.', '2008-03-27 20:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592394, 662222, 83313, '<td valign="top">In spite of the strong golden cast, probably from a sunset, I find this a soft and relaxing image.</td>', 'In spite of the strong golden cast, probably from a sunset, I find this a soft and relaxing image.', '2008-03-27 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592400, 660182, 83313, '<td valign="top">My impression is a "CLANG, CLANG, CLANG!" of something striking this metal. <br/> <br/>I found something really cool about this one. If you scroll the page up and down while viewing it, it looks like it''s moving and can induce motion sickness.</td>', 'My impression is a "CLANG, CLANG, CLANG!" of something striking this metal.  I found something really cool about this one. If you scroll the page up and down while viewing it, it looks like it''s moving and can induce motion sickness.', '2008-03-27 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592405, 661945, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the best pictures of a cheese grater I have seen to date. Kudos to you.</td>', 'One of the best pictures of a cheese grater I have seen to date. Kudos to you.', '2008-03-27 20:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592407, 661902, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Spiff like.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Spiff like.', '2008-03-27 20:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592412, 660077, 83313, '<td valign="top">DOF is reasonable and expected for such a close shot at an angle. The colors are a little dull, however. Some curves adjustments would really bring out the color and details.</td>', 'DOF is reasonable and expected for such a close shot at an angle. The colors are a little dull, however. Some curves adjustments would really bring out the color and details.', '2008-03-27 20:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592418, 660094, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the way the purple color on the top one stands out. Not as much fine detail showing in these as I would expect to see, though. Still gets a good score from me.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the way the purple color on the top one stands out. Not as much fine detail showing in these as I would expect to see, though. Still gets a good score from me.', '2008-03-27 20:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592420, 660077, 17986, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the DOF on this. It is certainly a pattern, but there is really nothing that draws me in. If there were some small element in one of the corners  for instance, there would be some place for my eyes to go. A pattern alone has to be pretty intriguing to stand alone.</td>', 'I kind of like the DOF on this. It is certainly a pattern, but there is really nothing that draws me in. If there were some small element in one of the corners  for instance, there would be some place for my eyes to go. A pattern alone has to be pretty intriguing to stand alone.', '2008-03-27 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592424, 660658, 17986, '<td valign="top">This is really good. I like the colors and how it really takes your eyes up and to the left leaving you to wonder what is just beyond the crop line. Nice Work!</td>', 'This is really good. I like the colors and how it really takes your eyes up and to the left leaving you to wonder what is just beyond the crop line. Nice Work!', '2008-03-27 20:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592426, 660403, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and contrast of this. But I see two patterns here fighting for dominance as the subject, and the way the fire escape is slightly cut off at the edge is not working for me, either. I think you should have focused on either the fire escape or the blocked in windows.</td>', 'I like the detail and contrast of this. But I see two patterns here fighting for dominance as the subject, and the way the fire escape is slightly cut off at the edge is not working for me, either. I think you should have focused on either the fire escape or the blocked in windows.', '2008-03-27 20:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592443, 661631, 17986, '<td valign="top">This is a pattern, but it is a bit to ordinary. This is the same point of view that we are used to seeing when we look at the floor. One trick for shooting ordinary things is to shoot them from a point of view that we are not used to seeing. If you had pointed the camera straight down and really took the time to line up the lines on the floor with the frame, or got down on the floor and shot from a low angle, the photo would be much more engaging. IMO. Keep it up!</td>', 'This is a pattern, but it is a bit to ordinary. This is the same point of view that we are used to seeing when we look at the floor. One trick for shooting ordinary things is to shoot them from a point of view that we are not used to seeing. If you had pointed the camera straight down and really took the time to line up the lines on the floor with the frame, or got down on the floor and shot from a low angle, the photo would be much more engaging. IMO. Keep it up!', '2008-03-27 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592446, 660184, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Nicely centered. Nice contrast. I do wish the DOF was a little broader. I think if outer part around the center was sharper it would take it up a notch.</td>', 'Nice capture! Nicely centered. Nice contrast. I do wish the DOF was a little broader. I think if outer part around the center was sharper it would take it up a notch.', '2008-03-27 21:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592448, 661850, 17986, '<td valign="top">I''m getting dinged right now for artistically using a narrow DOF in this challenge. I hope you are not getting the same cause it really works here. Nice shot!</td>', 'I''m getting dinged right now for artistically using a narrow DOF in this challenge. I hope you are not getting the same cause it really works here. Nice shot!', '2008-03-27 21:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592456, 660604, 17986, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve seen this shot from a lot of different photographers, and I gotta say, I think it loses a lot of it''s interest as a b/w. I do like everything else. Nice tonal range and framing. It looks like everything is in focus.</td>', 'Wow, I''ve seen this shot from a lot of different photographers, and I gotta say, I think it loses a lot of it''s interest as a b/w. I do like everything else. Nice tonal range and framing. It looks like everything is in focus.', '2008-03-27 21:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592459, 662136, 17986, '<td valign="top">Yup, this is a good one. One of the more creative I''ve seen so far. This works really well as a b/w and the framing is perfect.</td>', 'Yup, this is a good one. One of the more creative I''ve seen so far. This works really well as a b/w and the framing is perfect.', '2008-03-27 21:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592462, 662031, 17986, '<td valign="top">I like the framing here and the shadows really add a little something extra. Nice vivid color combinations too. The only thing I would change is the exposure. The concrete is pretty blown out. A levels adjustment in your favorite editing program could fix it right up.</td>', 'I like the framing here and the shadows really add a little something extra. Nice vivid color combinations too. The only thing I would change is the exposure. The concrete is pretty blown out. A levels adjustment in your favorite editing program could fix it right up.', '2008-03-27 21:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592463, 662207, 17986, '<td valign="top">A little too contrasty for my taste</td>', 'A little too contrasty for my taste', '2008-03-27 21:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592465, 662227, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. The framing is pretty good and the focus/DOF looks to be spot-on. It just seems a bit "muddy" in my opinion. The black point is fine, but I think the lights need to be lighter. Just a levels adjustment would have kicked it up a notch in my mind.</td>', 'Nice perspective. The framing is pretty good and the focus/DOF looks to be spot-on. It just seems a bit "muddy" in my opinion. The black point is fine, but I think the lights need to be lighter. Just a levels adjustment would have kicked it up a notch in my mind.', '2008-03-27 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592467, 661160, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I like the set up here. Nice job controlling the DOF.</td>', 'Nice concept. I like the set up here. Nice job controlling the DOF.', '2008-03-27 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592473, 661094, 83313, '<td valign="top">So is it the apartments that have a wonderful of the graveyard, or the dead folks with a wonderful view of the buildings?<br/> <br/>Good exposure, colors, decent composition, but it''s just not doing much for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'So is it the apartments that have a wonderful of the graveyard, or the dead folks with a wonderful view of the buildings? Good exposure, colors, decent composition, but it''s just not doing much for me, I''m afraid.', '2008-03-27 21:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592475, 661650, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little higher in the frame would have flowed better for me, but that''s minor. Nice and clear and bold. Looks like 60''s or ''70s architecture.</td>', 'Maybe a little higher in the frame would have flowed better for me, but that''s minor. Nice and clear and bold. Looks like 60''s or ''70s architecture.', '2008-03-27 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592489, 661924, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see a ton of what appears to be compression artifacts in this. Visible at all the high contrast edges. You file size is good, so I think this must have been highly compressed during editing, before it''s final save. A good thing to do is if you need to save your work, save it either as a TIF, which has no compression, or in your editors native file format. <br/> <br/>What is it? It could be a building, but it seems smaller than that. I think it may be a tray to hold microchips.</td>', 'I see a ton of what appears to be compression artifacts in this. Visible at all the high contrast edges. You file size is good, so I think this must have been highly compressed during editing, before it''s final save. A good thing to do is if you need to save your work, save it either as a TIF, which has no compression, or in your editors native file format.  What is it? It could be a building, but it seems smaller than that. I think it may be a tray to hold microchips.', '2008-03-27 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592492, 660560, 84124, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting pattern... but I''m having a hard time figuring out what I''m looking at.</td>', 'It''s an interesting pattern... but I''m having a hard time figuring out what I''m looking at.', '2008-03-27 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592497, 660668, 84124, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, would love to know what kind of moth that is.  Apollo?  Centering him a bit more would have helped with the challenge criteria.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, would love to know what kind of moth that is.  Apollo?  Centering him a bit more would have helped with the challenge criteria.', '2008-03-27 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592499, 660418, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, though I think some different lighting and adjustments may have been able to bring out some more oomph in it.</td>', 'Pretty good, though I think some different lighting and adjustments may have been able to bring out some more oomph in it.', '2008-03-27 21:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592501, 660560, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think the view through the grating was a good choice. Just the brick wall itself if a little too plain.</td>', 'I think the view through the grating was a good choice. Just the brick wall itself if a little too plain.', '2008-03-27 21:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592503, 661100, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good colors and detail. I think the right side needs a little skew correction.</td>', 'Good colors and detail. I think the right side needs a little skew correction.', '2008-03-27 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592504, 660546, 84124, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult aquarium photography is, and you hit this one spot on, well done.  7.</td>', 'I know how difficult aquarium photography is, and you hit this one spot on, well done.  7.', '2008-03-27 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592507, 662227, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of the posts, but I find my eye being drawn to that light colored building in the background. Perhaps a different crop may have helped it flow differently.</td>', 'I like the pattern of the posts, but I find my eye being drawn to that light colored building in the background. Perhaps a different crop may have helped it flow differently.', '2008-03-27 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592508, 661821, 84124, '<td valign="top">What the hey am I looking at???   Very interesting photo.  looking forward to coming back when it''s over.</td>', 'What the hey am I looking at???   Very interesting photo.  looking forward to coming back when it''s over.', '2008-03-27 21:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592509, 661763, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple, bold and very good.</td>', 'Simple, bold and very good.', '2008-03-27 21:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592510, 662053, 83313, '<td valign="top">So you like plaid?</td>', 'So you like plaid?', '2008-03-27 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592516, 661587, 34255, '<td valign="top">Too small</td>', 'Too small', '2008-03-27 22:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592517, 662238, 84124, '<td valign="top">Pleasing use of darks and lights, this will do well.</td>', 'Pleasing use of darks and lights, this will do well.', '2008-03-27 22:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592518, 661543, 66041, '<td valign="top">color is awful harsh...</td>', 'color is awful harsh...', '2008-03-27 22:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592520, 661998, 84124, '<td valign="top">emotive, creepy, well done.</td>', 'emotive, creepy, well done.', '2008-03-27 22:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592521, 661611, 66041, '<td valign="top">if only a few more were in focus....</td>', 'if only a few more were in focus....', '2008-03-27 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592523, 662042, 84124, '<td valign="top">Very creative, meets the challenge very well.  Brick + shadows somewhat dizzying, but well done.</td>', 'Very creative, meets the challenge very well.  Brick + shadows somewhat dizzying, but well done.', '2008-03-27 22:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592525, 660634, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and bold. I might have cropped out the left side to make it a little more abstract in appearance.</td>', 'Nice and bold. I might have cropped out the left side to make it a little more abstract in appearance.', '2008-03-27 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592527, 662216, 66041, '<td valign="top">is this snow drifts or clouds?  just doesn''t do much for me...</td>', 'is this snow drifts or clouds?  just doesn''t do much for me...', '2008-03-27 22:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592528, 661745, 91131, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2008-03-27 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592530, 661773, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good deep color on the bricks and strong contrast overall. The comp is kind of plain to me, but you did a great job on adjusting the colors and tones to get some impact out of an ordinary thing.</td>', 'Good deep color on the bricks and strong contrast overall. The comp is kind of plain to me, but you did a great job on adjusting the colors and tones to get some impact out of an ordinary thing.', '2008-03-27 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592531, 661916, 34255, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, might be more compelling from a different perspective.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, might be more compelling from a different perspective.', '2008-03-27 22:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592532, 662072, 66041, '<td valign="top">ouch.  my eyes.</td>', 'ouch.  my eyes.', '2008-03-27 22:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592535, 662119, 66041, '<td valign="top">almost an optical illusion..   cool.</td>', 'almost an optical illusion..   cool.', '2008-03-27 22:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
