(4592598, 662175, 83313, '<td valign="top">A normally colorful flower stands out when done in b/w. The backlighting brings out the details in the petals quite nicely. I like it.</td>', 'A normally colorful flower stands out when done in b/w. The backlighting brings out the details in the petals quite nicely. I like it.', '2008-03-27 22:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
