(4592667, 661650, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/5/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 7/7 <br/>Presentation: 7 <br/>Total: 6.1 <br/>Vote: 6<br/> <br/>Remarks: Clinical. Although the structure''s inscription is almost worthy of a title, yours is better. The logo next to it, however, should identify both building and location. For prosperity and the unimpaired enjoyment of image <i>and</i> title, I''d consider cloning it out. Otherwise quite fitting.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/5/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/6 Aesthetics/Technical: 7/7 Presentation: 7 Total: 6.1 Vote: 6 Remarks: Clinical. Although the structure''s inscription is almost worthy of a title, yours is better. The logo next to it, however, should identify both building and location. For prosperity and the unimpaired enjoyment of image and title, I''d consider cloning it out. Otherwise quite fitting.', '2008-03-27 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
