(4592697, 661100, 17986, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Sort of a helix look to it. I really like how the stairs make it fairly center-weighted at first glance, but the doors tip the balance upon a further investigation. There are lots of details that add interest without being distracting. And I love the grittyness of it. Nice work!</td>', 'Very nice. Sort of a helix look to it. I really like how the stairs make it fairly center-weighted at first glance, but the doors tip the balance upon a further investigation. There are lots of details that add interest without being distracting. And I love the grittyness of it. Nice work!', '2008-03-27 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592701, 661856, 17986, '<td valign="top">There is not so much of a pattern here as there is the absence of a pattern (randomness). But it''s is some pretty cool looking smoke.</td>', 'There is not so much of a pattern here as there is the absence of a pattern (randomness). But it''s is some pretty cool looking smoke.', '2008-03-28 00:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
