(4592752, 661923, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 <br/>Presentation: 5 <br/>Total: 6 <br/>Vote: 6<br/> <br/>Remarks: I have no idea what this is (a good thing/I''ve seen more than I care for). Neither can I tell whether the mystery is one or if it''s an ambiguity achieved by effect(s). As a photographer, this would be something I''d like to avoid.<br/> <br/>An "intrigue" would have similar connotations. And I''d "buy" the image (without any further explanation).</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 Presentation: 5 Total: 6 Vote: 6 Remarks: I have no idea what this is (a good thing/I''ve seen more than I care for). Neither can I tell whether the mystery is one or if it''s an ambiguity achieved by effect(s). As a photographer, this would be something I''d like to avoid. An "intrigue" would have similar connotations. And I''d "buy" the image (without any further explanation).', '2008-03-28 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
