(4593665, 662250, 84124, '<td valign="top">it pains me to view how good this photo is :-)  I tried to do the same thing but failed miserably (didn''t even enter the challenge it was so poor).  Nice to see how my shot would have come out if I had a some talent.  Adding to favs, this is a very strong shot.  not sure if the DPC crowd will share my enthusiasm for this shot since the pattern is not perfectly repeated.</td>', 'it pains me to view how good this photo is :-)  I tried to do the same thing but failed miserably (didn''t even enter the challenge it was so poor).  Nice to see how my shot would have come out if I had a some talent.  Adding to favs, this is a very strong shot.  not sure if the DPC crowd will share my enthusiasm for this shot since the pattern is not perfectly repeated.', '2008-03-28 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
