(4593681, 661223, 84124, '<td valign="top">I''m just blown away at all the mundane everyday items that folks found patterns in, this one among them.  I was ready to drive two hours to photograph a bridge, but after this challenge I now know that there were dozens of patterns right under my nose.  This is a great creative shot, I love the chromatic refraction in the upper right hand corner, just shaking my head at the creativity.  well done.</td>', 'I''m just blown away at all the mundane everyday items that folks found patterns in, this one among them.  I was ready to drive two hours to photograph a bridge, but after this challenge I now know that there were dozens of patterns right under my nose.  This is a great creative shot, I love the chromatic refraction in the upper right hand corner, just shaking my head at the creativity.  well done.', '2008-03-28 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
