(4595316, 662121, 89547, '<td valign="top">good photo, with nice value coming from the white inbetween the stones, gets a little blury at the top though.</td>', 'good photo, with nice value coming from the white inbetween the stones, gets a little blury at the top though.', '2008-03-29 11:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
