(4595552, 660649, 90658, '<td valign="top">These are great flowers.  The repition of the blossom on the stem is a wonderful quality, plus there is just enough randomness in those blossoms to make them engaging to view.  Way to go nature!  Congratulations on seeing it.</td>', 'These are great flowers.  The repition of the blossom on the stem is a wonderful quality, plus there is just enough randomness in those blossoms to make them engaging to view.  Way to go nature!  Congratulations on seeing it.', '2008-03-29 13:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
