(4595569, 660668, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a moth like this before.  The defensive coloring on the wings is gorgeous (go nature!).  The symmetry of shot is really nice.  The background colors seem blown out, but other than that, good job.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a moth like this before.  The defensive coloring on the wings is gorgeous (go nature!).  The symmetry of shot is really nice.  The background colors seem blown out, but other than that, good job.', '2008-03-29 13:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595571, 661906, 76789, '<td valign="top">I think that B&amp;W made the pattern catch attention more.10</td>', 'I think that B&W made the pattern catch attention more.10', '2008-03-29 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595573, 661893, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of shot I would expect to see on a postcard.  Better than a snapshot, but not quite framed art quality...this is not a criticism, just an observation.</td>', 'This is the sort of shot I would expect to see on a postcard.  Better than a snapshot, but not quite framed art quality...this is not a criticism, just an observation.', '2008-03-29 13:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595575, 661773, 90658, '<td valign="top">My only issue is the lighting/shading.  This was taken with natural light...thank you, but the time of day has caused a shadow to become reflected in the glass.  So, if that was your intent, yeah!  But it is not to my liking.</td>', 'My only issue is the lighting/shading.  This was taken with natural light...thank you, but the time of day has caused a shadow to become reflected in the glass.  So, if that was your intent, yeah!  But it is not to my liking.', '2008-03-29 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595580, 662036, 76789, '<td valign="top">I like every think about it, the pattern, the colors, the angle, 10</td>', 'I like every think about it, the pattern, the colors, the angle, 10', '2008-03-29 13:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595583, 661683, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred it if the writing on the wrappers was all the same way round. As it is there''s a bit too much randomness for my taste</td>', 'I think I would have preferred it if the writing on the wrappers was all the same way round. As it is there''s a bit too much randomness for my taste', '2008-03-29 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595585, 661904, 76789, '<td valign="top">the focus gave it a great value, 10</td>', 'the focus gave it a great value, 10', '2008-03-29 13:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595589, 662183, 76789, '<td valign="top">very well produced,great idea 10</td>', 'very well produced,great idea 10', '2008-03-29 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595593, 661067, 76789, '<td valign="top">good choice for color , 10</td>', 'good choice for color , 10', '2008-03-29 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595602, 661543, 76789, '<td valign="top">any less or more sarpness would spoil it, 9</td>', 'any less or more sarpness would spoil it, 9', '2008-03-29 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595603, 661962, 90658, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!  This shot is head''s and shoulders above the rest of the field in technique and presentation.  The colors are brilliant, the focus is spot on, there is no drift.  Everything that is here, is here for a reason.  I would suggest tilting the other direction.  Trick the eye into following gravity to hint at more speed.  My biggest problem, is this a pattern?  Is a diagonal line a pattern, not in the geometric sense, but this isn''t about geometetry.  Is the car a pattern, in the abstract...yes, but this shot is certainly not an abstract.  The wheels are a pattern, but they are obviously not the subject.  I am so confused about what to do with this.  It most certainly does not deserve DNMC, because intrepretation is loose and vague, but is this a 10 (technically, absolutely)?</td>', 'WOW!!!!  This shot is head''s and shoulders above the rest of the field in technique and presentation.  The colors are brilliant, the focus is spot on, there is no drift.  Everything that is here, is here for a reason.  I would suggest tilting the other direction.  Trick the eye into following gravity to hint at more speed.  My biggest problem, is this a pattern?  Is a diagonal line a pattern, not in the geometric sense, but this isn''t about geometetry.  Is the car a pattern, in the abstract...yes, but this shot is certainly not an abstract.  The wheels are a pattern, but they are obviously not the subject.  I am so confused about what to do with this.  It most certainly does not deserve DNMC, because intrepretation is loose and vague, but is this a 10 (technically, absolutely)?', '2008-03-29 13:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595604, 660405, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Wish it weren''t winter and the grass was greener.  But you can''t control that.</td>', 'Very cute.  Wish it weren''t winter and the grass was greener.  But you can''t control that.', '2008-03-29 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595606, 661113, 76789, '<td valign="top">a great idea for pattern, 9</td>', 'a great idea for pattern, 9', '2008-03-29 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595609, 662226, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, I think I would have found as many clothing items as I could with stripes.  And then either neatly folded everything or just jumbled them together.  This shot is rather blah!  But stripes are fun, so have some fun ;)</td>', 'You know, I think I would have found as many clothing items as I could with stripes.  And then either neatly folded everything or just jumbled them together.  This shot is rather blah!  But stripes are fun, so have some fun ;)', '2008-03-29 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595610, 660546, 76789, '<td valign="top">allthough u gone so far with the filter that you used, but its a very good shot, I gave it 9</td>', 'allthough u gone so far with the filter that you used, but its a very good shot, I gave it 9', '2008-03-29 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
