(4595651, 661745, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite liberating.  Lovely patterns of the feathers, the repetition in form, and the star of teh sun.  Amazing exposure.</td>', 'Quite liberating.  Lovely patterns of the feathers, the repetition in form, and the star of teh sun.  Amazing exposure.', '2008-03-29 14:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
