(4595937, 662214, 79955, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a less high key approach. otherwise  I feel this image with right amount of post processing to bring out more details can be a high scorer. 6</td>', 'Would have liked a less high key approach. otherwise  I feel this image with right amount of post processing to bring out more details can be a high scorer. 6', '2008-03-29 19:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
