(4596185, 660167, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel the lighting is harsh and overpowering.</td>', 'I feel the lighting is harsh and overpowering.', '2008-03-29 22:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596186, 662119, 17203, '<td valign="top">OK, obviously some kind of multiple exposure or prism effect, but I hope you explain it in detail. Very intriguing and expertly executed. The misalignment at bottom left was probably frustrating, and I wish the lighting was a bit more dramatic (right now it''s almost even, but the hot spots at left and shaded top right corner don''t seem "intentional" enough). Maybe a large window and reflector? Still, it''s one of my top 5 picks, and a likely ribbon contender. 9</td>', 'OK, obviously some kind of multiple exposure or prism effect, but I hope you explain it in detail. Very intriguing and expertly executed. The misalignment at bottom left was probably frustrating, and I wish the lighting was a bit more dramatic (right now it''s almost even, but the hot spots at left and shaded top right corner don''t seem "intentional" enough). Maybe a large window and reflector? Still, it''s one of my top 5 picks, and a likely ribbon contender. 9', '2008-03-29 22:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596189, 662250, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity. I can see this printed on canvas. The border doesn''t hurt but I much prefer it without it. (no vote)</td>', 'Great color and clarity. I can see this printed on canvas. The border doesn''t hurt but I much prefer it without it. (no vote)', '2008-03-29 22:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596190, 662200, 17203, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S a pattern! I''m not entirely sure what it is, but it looks like a huge aviary. You''ve done a great job handling the tones. I just wish there was some obvious focal point- a bird or something- to break up the, well... pattern. Without that, my eye is left wandering aimlessly even though the visual itself is interesting. 9</td>', 'Now THAT''S a pattern! I''m not entirely sure what it is, but it looks like a huge aviary. You''ve done a great job handling the tones. I just wish there was some obvious focal point- a bird or something- to break up the, well... pattern. Without that, my eye is left wandering aimlessly even though the visual itself is interesting. 9', '2008-03-29 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596193, 660604, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Cool place isn''t it? Did you have any problems with people getting into your shot?</td>', 'Nicely done. Cool place isn''t it? Did you have any problems with people getting into your shot?', '2008-03-29 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596194, 661661, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m probably in the minority here, but I wish the leaf weren''t there.  For me, it''s distracting from the pattern of the bricks, which appeal to me more than the pattern on the leaf. But great colors, textures and composition, of course.</td>', 'I''m probably in the minority here, but I wish the leaf weren''t there.  For me, it''s distracting from the pattern of the bricks, which appeal to me more than the pattern on the leaf. But great colors, textures and composition, of course.', '2008-03-29 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596195, 661639, 48697, '<td valign="top">very cool, the lines are great.</td>', 'very cool, the lines are great.', '2008-03-29 22:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596197, 660656, 17203, '<td valign="top">What a unique spray of water! Certainly the most intriguing of the "beaded water on glass shots," and the border works well here to balance the photo. One of the best in the challenge IMO. 9</td>', 'What a unique spray of water! Certainly the most intriguing of the "beaded water on glass shots," and the border works well here to balance the photo. One of the best in the challenge IMO. 9', '2008-03-29 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
