(4596418, 661231, 78660, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would work much better if the lines were straight vertical or horizontal.  You can tell that the arches on top are not the same distance from the top and the posts seem to be tilting to the right a little.  Otherwise, I really love the shot and all the repeating patterns.</td>', 'I think this photo would work much better if the lines were straight vertical or horizontal.  You can tell that the arches on top are not the same distance from the top and the posts seem to be tilting to the right a little.  Otherwise, I really love the shot and all the repeating patterns.', '2008-03-30 03:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
