(4596553, 661639, 89758, '<td valign="top">wow I love it. I think the angle is perfect and that the walking people add a lot to the picture. They really draw your eye towards the flow of the pattern without becoming the main image.</td>', 'wow I love it. I think the angle is perfect and that the walking people add a lot to the picture. They really draw your eye towards the flow of the pattern without becoming the main image.', '2008-03-30 09:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596556, 660129, 89758, '<td valign="top">I could stare at that forever. The way the light shines on the diamonds towards the back gives it a shimmering sort of feel. That along with the pattern itself is pretty awesome.</td>', 'I could stare at that forever. The way the light shines on the diamonds towards the back gives it a shimmering sort of feel. That along with the pattern itself is pretty awesome.', '2008-03-30 09:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596559, 662250, 89758, '<td valign="top">wow! That''s great. I love the separation between the b&amp;w and the color.</td>', 'wow! That''s great. I love the separation between the b&w and the color.', '2008-03-30 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596612, 661713, 91691, '<td valign="top">really like the trees as a back ground</td>', 'really like the trees as a back ground', '2008-03-30 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596615, 660634, 91691, '<td valign="top">the effect of the shaddow from the stairs is really good</td>', 'the effect of the shaddow from the stairs is really good', '2008-03-30 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596672, 662108, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!  Sharp with a good DOF.  The composition also works well, however, I wonder if a square crop might have also been effective.  It would give you enough space to place the dandelion in a ROT intersection without the outer circle truncated on three sides (perhaps just on one side).  Not sure if that would be an improvement, I''m just thinking aloud.  I do like this as you have it.</td>', 'Nice macro!  Sharp with a good DOF.  The composition also works well, however, I wonder if a square crop might have also been effective.  It would give you enough space to place the dandelion in a ROT intersection without the outer circle truncated on three sides (perhaps just on one side).  Not sure if that would be an improvement, I''m just thinking aloud.  I do like this as you have it.', '2008-03-30 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596681, 662233, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very creative pattern.  The flow is interrupted for me by not having the tines from the right lining up as well as the tines coming in from the left.  Also, I''m distracted by the top right two tine which looks badly bent.  I really love the creativity you show here and a little more detail tweeking would have made this very effective.</td>', 'Very creative pattern.  The flow is interrupted for me by not having the tines from the right lining up as well as the tines coming in from the left.  Also, I''m distracted by the top right two tine which looks badly bent.  I really love the creativity you show here and a little more detail tweeking would have made this very effective.', '2008-03-30 12:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596684, 660668, 83080, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an interesting creature.  I love the textures and details you captured contrasted with some very creamy bokeh.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an interesting creature.  I love the textures and details you captured contrasted with some very creamy bokeh.', '2008-03-30 12:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596693, 661661, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great detail, DOF, colors, composition, and the leaf is perfection.  Too many patters in this challenge lack a captivating subject.  Thanks for giving us something to look at.</td>', 'Great detail, DOF, colors, composition, and the leaf is perfection.  Too many patters in this challenge lack a captivating subject.  Thanks for giving us something to look at.', '2008-03-30 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596702, 661617, 83080, '<td valign="top">Wow, now THAT''s macro!  Fantastic composition and detail.  You really placed that limited DOF perfectly to get the most important parts sharp.  Nice curves too.</td>', 'Wow, now THAT''s macro!  Fantastic composition and detail.  You really placed that limited DOF perfectly to get the most important parts sharp.  Nice curves too.', '2008-03-30 12:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596707, 662262, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.  I suggest using the ''rule of thirds'' to place the red subject for more impact.</td>', 'Very creative idea.  I suggest using the ''rule of thirds'' to place the red subject for more impact.', '2008-03-30 12:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4596716, 660656, 83080, '<td valign="top">Fun idea!  The drops and ''sunbeams'' make for very effective pattern and this is just one of the most creative shots I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Fun idea!  The drops and ''sunbeams'' make for very effective pattern and this is just one of the most creative shots I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2008-03-30 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
