(4598428, 662238, 32011, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo... my favourite so far (50% of the way through voting).  Love the contrast and the composition... it''s very Escher like.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent photo... my favourite so far (50% of the way through voting).  Love the contrast and the composition... it''s very Escher like.  Well done.', '2008-03-31 09:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
