(4598436, 661919, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  You might consider a brown background so as to avoid any pesky comments about composition and framing or dead space.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  You might consider a brown background so as to avoid any pesky comments about composition and framing or dead space.', '2008-03-31 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598438, 660593, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well designed shot.  Is this inside of an aquarium?  There is a reflection in the lower right that I don''t think you meant to be there.</td>', 'Well designed shot.  Is this inside of an aquarium?  There is a reflection in the lower right that I don''t think you meant to be there.', '2008-03-31 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598441, 661986, 90658, '<td valign="top">With all of the colors to choose for a backdrop, black might not be the most dramatic.  A blue or soft yellow might accent the colors in the shell better.</td>', 'With all of the colors to choose for a backdrop, black might not be the most dramatic.  A blue or soft yellow might accent the colors in the shell better.', '2008-03-31 09:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598442, 660627, 32011, '<td valign="top">Strong colour.  Excellent composition.  It''s so simple, which is what makes it such an effective image.  I hope it doesn''t suffer from people not seeing *enough* of a pattern.  For me, the only thing I can fault in this, is the red is an iota flat...</td>', 'Strong colour.  Excellent composition.  It''s so simple, which is what makes it such an effective image.  I hope it doesn''t suffer from people not seeing *enough* of a pattern.  For me, the only thing I can fault in this, is the red is an iota flat...', '2008-03-31 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598446, 661531, 90658, '<td valign="top">Use as much size as possible.  The impact is lost because the pic is so small.</td>', 'Use as much size as possible.  The impact is lost because the pic is so small.', '2008-03-31 09:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598451, 661067, 32011, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  The contrast and tone is superb.  Sharp, interesting.  One of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  The contrast and tone is superb.  Sharp, interesting.  One of my favourites in this challenge.', '2008-03-31 09:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
