(4598455, 660688, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Different... which is what I really like in this image... but I can see it suffering in a "pattern" challenge b/c of it being a different type of pattern.  <br/> <br/>The colour is great... as is the contrast.<br/> <br/>I just hope that it does well enough in the challenge so that you''re not discouraged from doing similar things in the future.</td>', 'Nice.  Different... which is what I really like in this image... but I can see it suffering in a "pattern" challenge b/c of it being a different type of pattern.   The colour is great... as is the contrast. I just hope that it does well enough in the challenge so that you''re not discouraged from doing similar things in the future.', '2008-03-31 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598459, 662075, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  This has some fantastic elements, not the least being ing the coloring of that butterfly.  I know dealing with nature is tough, especially when you bring wildlife into the equation so my suggestions might not have worked here, but who knows when you might get another chance...<br/> <br/>The darkness behind the butterfly gives the illusion that the right wing is just there.  It''s hard to define the insect''s black body against the shadows and darkness of the background.  The colors of the flowers, while great, are not the best behind the red "hearts" in the wings.<br/> <br/>Again, not things you can control, but things to think about for any future shots.</td>', 'Interesting.  This has some fantastic elements, not the least being ing the coloring of that butterfly.  I know dealing with nature is tough, especially when you bring wildlife into the equation so my suggestions might not have worked here, but who knows when you might get another chance... The darkness behind the butterfly gives the illusion that the right wing is just there.  It''s hard to define the insect''s black body against the shadows and darkness of the background.  The colors of the flowers, while great, are not the best behind the red "hearts" in the wings. Again, not things you can control, but things to think about for any future shots.', '2008-03-31 09:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598460, 661427, 90658, '<td valign="top">This leaf almost looks like a wood grain in the b&amp;w.  So if that was your intent, well done.</td>', 'This leaf almost looks like a wood grain in the b&w.  So if that was your intent, well done.', '2008-03-31 09:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598464, 661385, 90658, '<td valign="top">Good dof choice, forces the eye towards the back/bottom and hints at the infinite.  Was there anyway to capture more of the detail?  As that is a secondary pattern, it would have been kind of cool.  I know that sometimes, these detail pieces fade and the ridges and "patterns" start to lose their definition, so perhaps this is the actual look.</td>', 'Good dof choice, forces the eye towards the back/bottom and hints at the infinite.  Was there anyway to capture more of the detail?  As that is a secondary pattern, it would have been kind of cool.  I know that sometimes, these detail pieces fade and the ridges and "patterns" start to lose their definition, so perhaps this is the actual look.', '2008-03-31 09:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598465, 662196, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Well balanced.  It''s very clean yet very interesting.  Only negative, for me is the other trail in the top right corner... needed to have more of them is you wanted the mirroring of the main subject type pattern too... if that wasn''t something you wanted, you may have tried to crop out more of them.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Well balanced.  It''s very clean yet very interesting.  Only negative, for me is the other trail in the top right corner... needed to have more of them is you wanted the mirroring of the main subject type pattern too... if that wasn''t something you wanted, you may have tried to crop out more of them.', '2008-03-31 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598467, 660769, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern.  Good concept.  The specks of dust of the record are extremely distracting though.</td>', 'Nice pattern.  Good concept.  The specks of dust of the record are extremely distracting though.', '2008-03-31 10:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598468, 661911, 90658, '<td valign="top">Intriguing architectural design and nice choice in taking this at night.  You Aussie''s tend to be more creative all around :)</td>', 'Intriguing architectural design and nice choice in taking this at night.  You Aussie''s tend to be more creative all around :)', '2008-03-31 10:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598470, 661647, 89341, '<td valign="top">lovely colours, nice capture</td>', 'lovely colours, nice capture', '2008-03-31 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598471, 661962, 89341, '<td valign="top">great capture, panning, tilted and patterns all in one!</td>', 'great capture, panning, tilted and patterns all in one!', '2008-03-31 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598472, 661919, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice photo... this will do well.  The clarity is good... sepia on this was an excellent choice... gives it an earthy warmth.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice photo... this will do well.  The clarity is good... sepia on this was an excellent choice... gives it an earthy warmth.  Well done.', '2008-03-31 10:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598474, 661973, 89341, '<td valign="top">The colours work really well in this</td>', 'The colours work really well in this', '2008-03-31 10:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598476, 661756, 90658, '<td valign="top">How tall is the glass building?  The reflection is obviously the subject as there is a definite pattern to it, but the glass is a secondary pattern and the windows are a tertiary.  If there was a way to widen this shot, without losing the initial intent, I would love to see that result, just to compare.</td>', 'How tall is the glass building?  The reflection is obviously the subject as there is a definite pattern to it, but the glass is a secondary pattern and the windows are a tertiary.  If there was a way to widen this shot, without losing the initial intent, I would love to see that result, just to compare.', '2008-03-31 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598478, 662229, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, almost abstract.  I can''t decide if it is a wing or stained glass window or something else entirely.  This is the kind of art that I would hang in my house.</td>', 'This is very pretty, almost abstract.  I can''t decide if it is a wing or stained glass window or something else entirely.  This is the kind of art that I would hang in my house.', '2008-03-31 10:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598480, 662233, 32011, '<td valign="top">Good detail.  Good concept.  I''m a bit disappointed by the DOF.  My eyes are drawn up the image into the out of focus section... which makes me want to go back to the first set of fork... only to be led back up... repeat.</td>', 'Good detail.  Good concept.  I''m a bit disappointed by the DOF.  My eyes are drawn up the image into the out of focus section... which makes me want to go back to the first set of fork... only to be led back up... repeat.', '2008-03-31 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598484, 661923, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  The angle from which it was shot has given it a brilliant perspective.  The details in the concrete is excellent.  The image is exceptionally well balanced.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  The angle from which it was shot has given it a brilliant perspective.  The details in the concrete is excellent.  The image is exceptionally well balanced.', '2008-03-31 10:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598485, 661741, 90658, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this several times and I still don''t see the pattern.  You do, or it wouldn''t be here, so I won''t hash the point.<br/> <br/>This is a good start to something wonderful.  The background doesn''t add anything to this shot, imo, and could just as easily been a basic sheet of some sort of color to offset the reds.<br/> <br/>Obviously, dark chocolate, but some more lighting on it to increase the detail of the Ghiradelli brand mark.  Perhaps more of the stem of the glass, or at least the entire bowl of it.  Right now we''re missing part of that.<br/> <br/>Good start!</td>', 'I have looked at this several times and I still don''t see the pattern.  You do, or it wouldn''t be here, so I won''t hash the point. This is a good start to something wonderful.  The background doesn''t add anything to this shot, imo, and could just as easily been a basic sheet of some sort of color to offset the reds. Obviously, dark chocolate, but some more lighting on it to increase the detail of the Ghiradelli brand mark.  Perhaps more of the stem of the glass, or at least the entire bowl of it.  Right now we''re missing part of that. Good start!', '2008-03-31 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598486, 662202, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours.  The red and the blues balance one another perfectly.  The contrast is excellent.  I may have cropped the top of the image (the grass/bush area) out though.  Also, the shadow in the foreground is a bit of an issue.</td>', 'Beautiful colours.  The red and the blues balance one another perfectly.  The contrast is excellent.  I may have cropped the top of the image (the grass/bush area) out though.  Also, the shadow in the foreground is a bit of an issue.', '2008-03-31 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598488, 662237, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love the minimalism of this photo... basic colour, texture and pattern all combining to make a great photo.</td>', 'I love the minimalism of this photo... basic colour, texture and pattern all combining to make a great photo.', '2008-03-31 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598491, 661160, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  This is something I''d expect to see in a stockphoto site.  It''s clean and sharp and generic enough to have a broad appeal required of a stock photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice photo.  This is something I''d expect to see in a stockphoto site.  It''s clean and sharp and generic enough to have a broad appeal required of a stock photo.  Well done.', '2008-03-31 10:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
