(4598494, 660604, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Crisp.  The perspective is extremely effective in making what was potential a dull dome photo into something very dynamic.  Congratulations on producing a stunning photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Crisp.  The perspective is extremely effective in making what was potential a dull dome photo into something very dynamic.  Congratulations on producing a stunning photo.', '2008-03-31 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
