(4598765, 662150, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on the middle part of the dress. And how you didn''t focus on the two on the outside.</td>', 'I like the focus on the middle part of the dress. And how you didn''t focus on the two on the outside.', '2008-03-31 11:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
