(4599117, 661747, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''d almost prefer to see only the hands and arms of your subject, or perhaps adding those of the little girl as well.  There is obviously a story here, but without more information the viewer is left confused.  I feel like I''m looking at a snap-shot rather than an artistic piece.</td>', 'I''d almost prefer to see only the hands and arms of your subject, or perhaps adding those of the little girl as well.  There is obviously a story here, but without more information the viewer is left confused.  I feel like I''m looking at a snap-shot rather than an artistic piece.', '2008-03-31 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4599121, 660363, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t speak to me.  Sorry.<br/> <br/>Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'This just doesn''t speak to me.  Sorry. Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-31 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4599126, 661649, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel as if the lighting is too harsh.  Could you have cropped out the brightest area and then left everything else?  The shading is very nice, but not in balance with the lower right corner.</td>', 'I feel as if the lighting is too harsh.  Could you have cropped out the brightest area and then left everything else?  The shading is very nice, but not in balance with the lower right corner.', '2008-03-31 14:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
