(4599139, 662072, 90658, '<td valign="top">I actually like everything about this except that odd white tube in the center.  I know exactly what it is, but I think that changing the angle would decrease the impact of the white light coming through.</td>', 'I actually like everything about this except that odd white tube in the center.  I know exactly what it is, but I think that changing the angle would decrease the impact of the white light coming through.', '2008-03-31 14:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
