(4599150, 660127, 91314, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a pattern, it is not intreguing.  It does not make me stop in my tracks to admire your vision you maybe portraying.  As Randy Jackson (American Idol) would say "It''s not my thing dawg."</td>', 'Even though this is a pattern, it is not intreguing.  It does not make me stop in my tracks to admire your vision you maybe portraying.  As Randy Jackson (American Idol) would say "It''s not my thing dawg."', '2008-03-31 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
