(4600425, 661893, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and view, but the perspective seems a little skewed or distorted and that really throws the whole thing off.</td>', 'Nice colors and view, but the perspective seems a little skewed or distorted and that really throws the whole thing off.', '2008-04-01 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4600431, 662000, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes a nice bold semi-abstract. I like the backlit green. I find the border excessively wide, though.</td>', 'Makes a nice bold semi-abstract. I like the backlit green. I find the border excessively wide, though.', '2008-04-01 01:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4600438, 662216, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasing cloud pattern with good color and detail, though I don''t find it stands out from the pack, I''m afraid</td>', 'A pleasing cloud pattern with good color and detail, though I don''t find it stands out from the pack, I''m afraid', '2008-04-01 01:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4600445, 661223, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and pattern of the shadows on this. I find the focal point to be too much in the center, though. I think it would have flowed much better with a different crop.</td>', 'Nice detail and pattern of the shadows on this. I find the focal point to be too much in the center, though. I think it would have flowed much better with a different crop.', '2008-04-01 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4600454, 661923, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. I think perhaps you should have cropped it with the focal point off center a bit and more to the top of the frame. The whole image is so strong, however, that for this one it is a minor thing.</td>', 'Very cool looking. I think perhaps you should have cropped it with the focal point off center a bit and more to the top of the frame. The whole image is so strong, however, that for this one it is a minor thing.', '2008-04-01 01:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4600469, 661385, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting pattern, but it appears pixelated and unclear. I see lots of evidence of heavy JPEG compression, but your file size does not indicate heavy compression on the final image. It must have been highly compressed somewhere else along the way, though. Save intermediate steps as a TIFF or your image editor''s native format in order to avoid compression loss..</td>', 'It''s an interesting pattern, but it appears pixelated and unclear. I see lots of evidence of heavy JPEG compression, but your file size does not indicate heavy compression on the final image. It must have been highly compressed somewhere else along the way, though. Save intermediate steps as a TIFF or your image editor''s native format in order to avoid compression loss..', '2008-04-01 01:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4601395, 662081, 89341, '<td valign="top">it''s a little too plain for my liking, sorry. Maybe if there was an object on one of the corners, or a brighter coloured cloth perhaps</td>', 'it''s a little too plain for my liking, sorry. Maybe if there was an object on one of the corners, or a brighter coloured cloth perhaps', '2008-04-01 08:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
