(4601878, 662210, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking some tweaking of the feather placement.  Have the central vein placed so that it comes directly from the corner, any corner and the eye wouldn''t have to work so hard to get to the focal point.</td>', 'I''m thinking some tweaking of the feather placement.  Have the central vein placed so that it comes directly from the corner, any corner and the eye wouldn''t have to work so hard to get to the focal point.', '2008-04-01 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
