(4601894, 661196, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think a different background color.  Keep it light in color, but something other than white.  Maybe pink or a very light pastel lilac.</td>', 'I think a different background color.  Keep it light in color, but something other than white.  Maybe pink or a very light pastel lilac.', '2008-04-01 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4601896, 661275, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of tilt and crop.  This one is a bit counterintuitive.  Usually, I prefer to see things more complete, but by showing just a piece of it, you communicate the massiveness better than by showing the entire thing.  Well done.</td>', 'Interesting choice of tilt and crop.  This one is a bit counterintuitive.  Usually, I prefer to see things more complete, but by showing just a piece of it, you communicate the massiveness better than by showing the entire thing.  Well done.', '2008-04-01 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4601902, 662197, 90658, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the focus is right.  I don''t think it is oof, nor do I think the dof is wrong, but things aren''t working here.  It''s like a combo between the two.  The center of the flower is obviously your subject, but the focus effects are making it difficult for me to just stay there.  My eyes are all over the place attempting to bring this into order.  I would send this to the Critique Club or one of the forums for some insight.</td>', 'I don''t think the focus is right.  I don''t think it is oof, nor do I think the dof is wrong, but things aren''t working here.  It''s like a combo between the two.  The center of the flower is obviously your subject, but the focus effects are making it difficult for me to just stay there.  My eyes are all over the place attempting to bring this into order.  I would send this to the Critique Club or one of the forums for some insight.', '2008-04-01 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4601904, 661840, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I don''t think that the title should tell the story.  I actually get this shot without the benefit of the title.  I understand that you are forcing those DNMC hounds into your way of thinking, but sometimes it''s best to just let things stand on their own merit and see what happens.</td>', 'Hmmm, I don''t think that the title should tell the story.  I actually get this shot without the benefit of the title.  I understand that you are forcing those DNMC hounds into your way of thinking, but sometimes it''s best to just let things stand on their own merit and see what happens.', '2008-04-01 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
