(4602845, 662214, 80458, '<td valign="top">Wow. Really Wow. At first, I saw overexposed photo and I was thinking about a 4-5 range, but for some reason I just think it is really beautiful.</td>', 'Wow. Really Wow. At first, I saw overexposed photo and I was thinking about a 4-5 range, but for some reason I just think it is really beautiful.', '2008-04-01 14:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
