(4603076, 661955, 80458, '<td valign="top">I really think you should''ve cropped out the decks in this photo. He''s distracting the true patterns.</td>', 'I really think you should''ve cropped out the decks in this photo. He''s distracting the true patterns.', '2008-04-01 16:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
