(4605281, 661952, 30982, '<td valign="top">Call me odd, but I think this would have worked with the wheel in the air, especially given your title.  :-)  It does show the pattern well and I like the corresponding pattern of the distorted by perspective wheel against the more circular shadow.  That said, your outtake with the two spokes is better technically and for the challenge - the background on that one is brighter, more cheerful, a better yellow.  As you noted here, toning down the color cast hurt this a bit.  The angle of this one is more dymamic, more challenging, whereas the angle of your outtake is more sedate, more common if you will.  The outtake also has more of the focus on the tread pattern, especially with the use of the shallow DOF, where here the "feel" is more for the structure of the wheel itself, more taken as a whole.</td>', 'Call me odd, but I think this would have worked with the wheel in the air, especially given your title.  :-)  It does show the pattern well and I like the corresponding pattern of the distorted by perspective wheel against the more circular shadow.  That said, your outtake with the two spokes is better technically and for the challenge - the background on that one is brighter, more cheerful, a better yellow.  As you noted here, toning down the color cast hurt this a bit.  The angle of this one is more dymamic, more challenging, whereas the angle of your outtake is more sedate, more common if you will.  The outtake also has more of the focus on the tread pattern, especially with the use of the shallow DOF, where here the "feel" is more for the structure of the wheel itself, more taken as a whole.', '2008-04-02 04:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605299, 662238, 49109, '<td valign="top">great shot, congrats on your top10 finish</td>', 'great shot, congrats on your top10 finish', '2008-04-02 04:20:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605305, 662119, 49109, '<td valign="top">very creative technique! congrats on your top 10 finish!</td>', 'very creative technique! congrats on your top 10 finish!', '2008-04-02 04:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605323, 662214, 30982, '<td valign="top">The overexposure was perfect for this in my opinion.  Please be careful about taking advice/incorporating comments if by doing so it changes what you wanted to do with the picture.  If you want to score better here, then by all means you should have properly exposed this.  But I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well as it did.  Welcome to DPC and I look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'The overexposure was perfect for this in my opinion.  Please be careful about taking advice/incorporating comments if by doing so it changes what you wanted to do with the picture.  If you want to score better here, then by all means you should have properly exposed this.  But I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well as it did.  Welcome to DPC and I look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2008-04-02 04:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605330, 660880, 30982, '<td valign="top">I did vote, and this was one of my top picks.  ''Grats on the top ten!</td>', 'I did vote, and this was one of my top picks.  ''Grats on the top ten!', '2008-04-02 04:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
