(4605511, 661623, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Didnt vote but thought this one stood out strong. A shame to be behind yanko though. Nice work Oliver. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well it''s his fault for shooting the roman numeral 5. Where else is it going to finish but 5th? :P Now that I look at my shot again it seems I made a similar mistake. Crap.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-02 04:46:12.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: Didnt vote but thought this one stood out strong. A shame to be behind yanko though. Nice work Oliver.   Well it''s his fault for shooting the roman numeral 5. Where else is it going to finish but 5th? :P Now that I look at my shot again it seems I made a similar mistake. Crap.', '2008-04-02 05:44:44.000000', '2008-04-02 05:46:12.000000', 0),
