(4605951, 662170, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful because of the chaos. Swirls and circles and squares and rectangles all with a splash of beautiful rich color.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful because of the chaos. Swirls and circles and squares and rectangles all with a splash of beautiful rich color.', '2008-04-02 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605981, 662065, 11854, '<td valign="top">I love that someone described this as distracting, lol. It should distract you, it should keep you busy examining it and finding all it conceals. I love this, really. There are many, many patterns here and they are all interesting.</td>', 'I love that someone described this as distracting, lol. It should distract you, it should keep you busy examining it and finding all it conceals. I love this, really. There are many, many patterns here and they are all interesting.', '2008-04-02 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4605987, 662137, 49109, '<td valign="top">hehe, now that you mentioned it I see that''s four sheets of paper. maybe you should have called it "3 colors". congrats on the 4th, though</td>', 'hehe, now that you mentioned it I see that''s four sheets of paper. maybe you should have called it "3 colors". congrats on the 4th, though', '2008-04-02 09:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606004, 662000, 49109, '<td valign="top">I found the border to be too bold, while the image itself is too small. try to make the most of the 640 px height you have. The black border alone would have given enough depth. If your image lost sharpness during resizing, you probably don''t use the best resizing method; in photoshop it would be "bicubic sharper" when downsizing.</td>', 'I found the border to be too bold, while the image itself is too small. try to make the most of the 640 px height you have. The black border alone would have given enough depth. If your image lost sharpness during resizing, you probably don''t use the best resizing method; in photoshop it would be "bicubic sharper" when downsizing.', '2008-04-02 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606009, 661636, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Love the texture and color. I''m no longer familiar with his work, I know I read it in high school, but that was lifetimes ago. It could very well be another world (or moon), viewed from so far overhead that all you can see are the roads and flatness. I like the circular fade off at the top.</td>', 'Nicely done! Love the texture and color. I''m no longer familiar with his work, I know I read it in high school, but that was lifetimes ago. It could very well be another world (or moon), viewed from so far overhead that all you can see are the roads and flatness. I like the circular fade off at the top.', '2008-04-02 09:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606013, 661623, 73235, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your top 5 finish. great symmetry and the color !!!</td>', 'Congrats to your top 5 finish. great symmetry and the color !!!', '2008-04-02 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606029, 662247, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Great contrast with the yellow lines bisecting the circular pattern. I also like how it''s sharp, then oof, then sharp, then oof. And of course you have very beautiful bokeh here!</td>', 'Nicely done! Great contrast with the yellow lines bisecting the circular pattern. I also like how it''s sharp, then oof, then sharp, then oof. And of course you have very beautiful bokeh here!', '2008-04-02 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
