(4606153, 661660, 87808, '<td valign="top">I still think this is a wonderful pattern.  I love the leading lines and gentle ripples, well done!!</td>', 'I still think this is a wonderful pattern.  I love the leading lines and gentle ripples, well done!!', '2008-04-02 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606155, 661975, 87808, '<td valign="top">Lovely, simple pure curving lines!!! well done!!!!! No tarring and feathering this week!!! hehehe</td>', 'Lovely, simple pure curving lines!!! well done!!!!! No tarring and feathering this week!!! hehehe', '2008-04-02 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606160, 662274, 87808, '<td valign="top">That is just wrong that you got all those 3,2 and 2-1''s.  I thought that this was really good, after seeing all the very busy patterns this one was a relief on the eyes. Well done!</td>', 'That is just wrong that you got all those 3,2 and 2-1''s.  I thought that this was really good, after seeing all the very busy patterns this one was a relief on the eyes. Well done!', '2008-04-02 10:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606172, 662222, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - I would not have guessed this was a pine tree.  Well I gave it a 6.  I thought it was pretty, and I liked the balance between blur and sharpness. I also thought the line of shadow was pretty cool.  I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted something else to reach out and grab me - like I was looking for a focal point.</td>', 'Very interesting - I would not have guessed this was a pine tree.  Well I gave it a 6.  I thought it was pretty, and I liked the balance between blur and sharpness. I also thought the line of shadow was pretty cool.  I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted something else to reach out and grab me - like I was looking for a focal point.', '2008-04-02 10:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606173, 661210, 67697, '<td valign="top">It must be something to see this in person.  The colors are amazing!</td>', 'It must be something to see this in person.  The colors are amazing!', '2008-04-02 10:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606187, 661952, 67697, '<td valign="top">I can''t add any more to what others have said.  I liked seeing this during the challenge.  I thought the yellow background was a good choice to help make the wheel just pop out of the picture.  Something fun to try here tho would be to do a border like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">BHuseman</a> did with this photo <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=629284" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/796/120/629284.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/796/120/629284.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/796/120/629284.jpg"/></a>.  I think it would be fun to see the wheel just kind of 3-D pop out of the background.  And if you do this, and figure out how to do it, let me know lol.</td>', 'I can''t add any more to what others have said.  I liked seeing this during the challenge.  I thought the yellow background was a good choice to help make the wheel just pop out of the picture.  Something fun to try here tho would be to do a border like  BHuseman did with this photo .  I think it would be fun to see the wheel just kind of 3-D pop out of the background.  And if you do this, and figure out how to do it, let me know lol.', '2008-04-02 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606233, 661917, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did like seeing this during the challenge.  So soft and pretty - natural patterns at it''s best.  I love how the soft light is shining on it and makes it stand out from the background.</td>', 'I did like seeing this during the challenge.  So soft and pretty - natural patterns at it''s best.  I love how the soft light is shining on it and makes it stand out from the background.', '2008-04-02 10:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606257, 661952, 11854, '<td valign="top">The yellow background is a great choice against the black, it also matches well with the golden part of the rubber. I personally like the shadow. I think I agree with Deb on the position though, this would work better with the tire in the air.</td>', 'The yellow background is a great choice against the black, it also matches well with the golden part of the rubber. I personally like the shadow. I think I agree with Deb on the position though, this would work better with the tire in the air.', '2008-04-02 10:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606276, 661636, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I gave it a 6 because i saw the patterns and it was something that made you stop and look for a minute.  For my personal taste, there''s nothing there to hold my interest past that moment of observation and that''s why I think I did not give it a higher score.</td>', 'Well I gave it a 6 because i saw the patterns and it was something that made you stop and look for a minute.  For my personal taste, there''s nothing there to hold my interest past that moment of observation and that''s why I think I did not give it a higher score.', '2008-04-02 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606279, 661959, 87808, '<td valign="top">A wonderful cool colour shot.  The pattern is right there in front of your eye.  I am stunned that this got the score it did.  I gave this a 9, the colour is so cool and rich, the greens bleeding into the blues is perfect.  You hit this challenge on the head!  I think you did amazingly well.</td>', 'A wonderful cool colour shot.  The pattern is right there in front of your eye.  I am stunned that this got the score it did.  I gave this a 9, the colour is so cool and rich, the greens bleeding into the blues is perfect.  You hit this challenge on the head!  I think you did amazingly well.', '2008-04-02 10:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606281, 661210, 11854, '<td valign="top">The colors here are stunningly beautiful. I do see the pattern, circular throughout the walls of the cave, then the repetitive pattern of the "broken" walls. It is gorgeous!</td>', 'The colors here are stunningly beautiful. I do see the pattern, circular throughout the walls of the cave, then the repetitive pattern of the "broken" walls. It is gorgeous!', '2008-04-02 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606286, 662170, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very pretty and all the lines and patterns made this interesting to look at.  I did give it a 6 but would have given it a higher score if the slight blur was not there.  With all these beautiful lines, I am expecting something crisp and sharp so that I can enjoy all the specific details in the architecture.</td>', 'I thought this was very pretty and all the lines and patterns made this interesting to look at.  I did give it a 6 but would have given it a higher score if the slight blur was not there.  With all these beautiful lines, I am expecting something crisp and sharp so that I can enjoy all the specific details in the architecture.', '2008-04-02 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606294, 662222, 11854, '<td valign="top">That purple is gorgeous! As far as score goes, I think it was the dof that hurt you. The patterns are obvious, and there are quite a few that stand out, the shadow and light, the lines, the markings. Overall, it was done beautifully.</td>', 'That purple is gorgeous! As far as score goes, I think it was the dof that hurt you. The patterns are obvious, and there are quite a few that stand out, the shadow and light, the lines, the markings. Overall, it was done beautifully.', '2008-04-02 10:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606299, 662065, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did give this a 6 for the beautiful mix of pattern, light and shadow.  I''m thinking that the reason why I did not give this a higher score was because of the color tone.  Have you tried this in just pure black and white?</td>', 'I did give this a 6 for the beautiful mix of pattern, light and shadow.  I''m thinking that the reason why I did not give this a higher score was because of the color tone.  Have you tried this in just pure black and white?', '2008-04-02 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606306, 661959, 11854, '<td valign="top">These are beautiful and relaxing colors. A warm breeze on a chilly spring day. Nature at it''s finest. As far as the pattern goes, it''s natures chaos, the loveliest of all patterns.</td>', 'These are beautiful and relaxing colors. A warm breeze on a chilly spring day. Nature at it''s finest. As far as the pattern goes, it''s natures chaos, the loveliest of all patterns.', '2008-04-02 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606309, 662247, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  I liked seeing the details on the rings.  Very nice macro.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  I liked seeing the details on the rings.  Very nice macro.', '2008-04-02 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606322, 662222, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> Very interesting - I would not have guessed this was a pine tree.  Well I gave it a 6.  I thought it was pretty, and I liked the balance between blur and sharpness. I also thought the line of shadow was pretty cool.  I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted something else to reach out and grab me - like I was looking for a focal point. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I feel the same way. But I thought it was pretty enough to score high. Why do I care? I don''t even know!</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: Very interesting - I would not have guessed this was a pine tree.  Well I gave it a 6.  I thought it was pretty, and I liked the balance between blur and sharpness. I also thought the line of shadow was pretty cool.  I think I did not give it a higher score because I wanted something else to reach out and grab me - like I was looking for a focal point.   I feel the same way. But I thought it was pretty enough to score high. Why do I care? I don''t even know!', '2008-04-02 10:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606332, 661684, 50695, '<td valign="top">Your analysis sounded far-fetched when I read it, but when I actually look at the picture it makes sense. I think it''s the grid on the sidewalk: it looks like this photo was drawn on graph paper... an engineer''s draftwork... to study this notion of patterns in the universe.</td>', 'Your analysis sounded far-fetched when I read it, but when I actually look at the picture it makes sense. I think it''s the grid on the sidewalk: it looks like this photo was drawn on graph paper... an engineer''s draftwork... to study this notion of patterns in the universe.', '2008-04-02 10:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606344, 662183, 89341, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> Just my opinion, and you can feel free to throw it away, but a chiched tired theme. I long for something new. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s new to me, I''ve never seen it before, was one of my favorite shots from the challenge :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-02 11:26:03.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: Just my opinion, and you can feel free to throw it away, but a chiched tired theme. I long for something new.   It''s new to me, I''ve never seen it before, was one of my favorite shots from the challenge :)', '2008-04-02 10:47:18.000000', '2008-04-02 12:26:03.000000', 0),
(4606346, 662062, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hey great minds think alike lol (go see my patterns pic).  I like how you kept more of a natural color but the extra sharpening detracts from that beauty.  This would be pretty with some kind of water color filter.</td>', 'Hey great minds think alike lol (go see my patterns pic).  I like how you kept more of a natural color but the extra sharpening detracts from that beauty.  This would be pretty with some kind of water color filter.', '2008-04-02 10:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606352, 661684, 50695, '<td valign="top">If you haven''t learned anything at DPC then you must have been great when you got here. Just one example is what you did in the desert. The portfolio from that "trip" is the result of a photographer being in the desert, not just a soldier with a camera.</td>', 'If you haven''t learned anything at DPC then you must have been great when you got here. Just one example is what you did in the desert. The portfolio from that "trip" is the result of a photographer being in the desert, not just a soldier with a camera.', '2008-04-02 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606357, 661925, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like it. The silhouetting makes it clear to me that this is a study of the fractal-like patterning of branches. Clear as day.<br/> <br/>But I''m weird, apparently.</td>', 'I like it. The silhouetting makes it clear to me that this is a study of the fractal-like patterning of branches. Clear as day. But I''m weird, apparently.', '2008-04-02 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606371, 661636, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the processing, colors and texture. This would have easily been a 6 from me. To get higher, I would want a more interesting shape, perhaps with shadows and showing more of the palm/hand.</td>', 'I love the processing, colors and texture. This would have easily been a 6 from me. To get higher, I would want a more interesting shape, perhaps with shadows and showing more of the palm/hand.', '2008-04-02 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606374, 661636, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh, I''m a dummy. I was thinking of the continent, not the moon. You have the right shape for a moon. Good job!</td>', 'oh, I''m a dummy. I was thinking of the continent, not the moon. You have the right shape for a moon. Good job!', '2008-04-02 10:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606386, 662170, 50695, '<td valign="top">yeah, this does a good job of showing the excessiveness of cathedral architecture. It gives a glimpse of many different patterns at once. Good fit to the challenge. (if you care about the opinion of an immature lout like me)</td>', 'yeah, this does a good job of showing the excessiveness of cathedral architecture. It gives a glimpse of many different patterns at once. Good fit to the challenge. (if you care about the opinion of an immature lout like me)', '2008-04-02 10:57:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606392, 662170, 50695, '<td valign="top">p.s.<br/> <br/>1. I don''t see any blur<br/> <br/>2. If there is any blur, then I like it. More detail would distract from the patterns.</td>', 'p.s. 1. I don''t see any blur 2. If there is any blur, then I like it. More detail would distract from the patterns.', '2008-04-02 10:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606403, 660880, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific image, Stefan.  Congratulations on your super finish.</td>', 'Terrific image, Stefan.  Congratulations on your super finish.', '2008-04-02 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606426, 662267, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, I liked the background.  The green on top of the pink made me think of Easter lol.  Very pretty catch of the curling blades and I like the hint of light on them too.</td>', 'It''s funny, I liked the background.  The green on top of the pink made me think of Easter lol.  Very pretty catch of the curling blades and I like the hint of light on them too.', '2008-04-02 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606427, 661925, 14476, '<td valign="top">Bear,your title made me appreciate this image even more.  It''s just lovely and I scored it high.  Your title helped me see in in context and that made it even better.  Sorry it scored low overall, but some of us appreciated it.<br/>:))</td>', 'Bear,your title made me appreciate this image even more.  It''s just lovely and I scored it high.  Your title helped me see in in context and that made it even better.  Sorry it scored low overall, but some of us appreciated it.:))', '2008-04-02 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606449, 661885, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Brian!  This is beautiful.  I am really disappointed that it didn''t score better.  I read thru some of the comments and totally disagree with most of the criticisms.  Because pattern is all about busy -- and this photo is MUCH better centered than if you had put the mast off to one side (in my opinion).   I think people get way wayyyyyyyy to hung up on thinking you can''t ever have a good photo without that often boring rule of thirds in play.  <br/> <br/>Sorry.  This deserves to have finished much better than it did!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Brian!  This is beautiful.  I am really disappointed that it didn''t score better.  I read thru some of the comments and totally disagree with most of the criticisms.  Because pattern is all about busy -- and this photo is MUCH better centered than if you had put the mast off to one side (in my opinion).   I think people get way wayyyyyyyy to hung up on thinking you can''t ever have a good photo without that often boring rule of thirds in play.   Sorry.  This deserves to have finished much better than it did! ', '2008-04-02 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606451, 662227, 89515, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the great comments. It''s really a learning experience.</td>', 'Thank you for all the great comments. It''s really a learning experience.', '2008-04-02 11:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606475, 662065, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I like the cloud, which seems like a whimsical intrusion into your idea.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I like the cloud, which seems like a whimsical intrusion into your idea.', '2008-04-02 11:16:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606485, 662247, 50695, '<td valign="top">good fulfillment of the challenge. to get a really high score from me, I think I''d need the background to contribute more to the composition. Even when it''s OOF, a background can contribute shape and texture to a photo.</td>', 'good fulfillment of the challenge. to get a really high score from me, I think I''d need the background to contribute more to the composition. Even when it''s OOF, a background can contribute shape and texture to a photo.', '2008-04-02 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606489, 661210, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good job of making this shot fit the challenge. It''s the play of light that creates the patterns more than the rock layers.</td>', 'Good job of making this shot fit the challenge. It''s the play of light that creates the patterns more than the rock layers.', '2008-04-02 11:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606493, 661959, 50695, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the colors and the shallow DOF adds interest.</td>', 'Pretty. I like the colors and the shallow DOF adds interest.', '2008-04-02 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
