(4608756, 662137, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oooooo goody 4th place!  Isn''t it the best?  I mean in that "so close to that little splash of yellow, I can taste it sort of way?"  : )  Just teasing of course...great score &amp; finsh.  Congrats Yanko!  Your average is getting rediculous BTW!</td>', 'Oooooo goody 4th place!  Isn''t it the best?  I mean in that "so close to that little splash of yellow, I can taste it sort of way?"  : )  Just teasing of course...great score & finsh.  Congrats Yanko!  Your average is getting rediculous BTW!', '2008-04-02 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4608760, 662137, 48227, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'FANTASTIC!!!!!!!!!', '2008-04-02 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
