(4613901, 661917, 62318, '<td valign="top">Love the light and the detail on this one. Plants have an amazing geometric symmetry to them. Good catch.</td>', 'Love the light and the detail on this one. Plants have an amazing geometric symmetry to them. Good catch.', '2008-04-04 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
