(4629671, 660187, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hi Roz - I gave this an 8 during the challenge.  I thought this was sooooo pretty and natural.  I loved the clarity of the water and how the drops were floating in the air.  Beautiful contrast with the greens too.</td>', 'Hi Roz - I gave this an 8 during the challenge.  I thought this was sooooo pretty and natural.  I loved the clarity of the water and how the drops were floating in the air.  Beautiful contrast with the greens too.', '2008-04-10 10:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4631531, 660880, 55838, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top ten.  I''m glad to see this photo rank so well as it is very strong.</td>', 'Congrats on top ten.  I''m glad to see this photo rank so well as it is very strong.', '2008-04-10 22:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4639254, 661223, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is really really nice - many interesting lines - how did it fall through the cracks and miss public notice??</td>', 'This is really really nice - many interesting lines - how did it fall through the cracks and miss public notice??', '2008-04-14 18:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4639908, 662137, 32933, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even think about the "Patterns." Good job.<br/> <br/>The colors are amazing. I never would have thought of that. I''m a little iffy on the yellow, of course, but green and blue are two of my most favorite colors. Haha, guess my third, if you can.<br/> <br/>I love it. Even the little ''shine'' at the top right just <i>looks</i> like it belongs there.</td>', 'I didn''t even think about the "Patterns." Good job. The colors are amazing. I never would have thought of that. I''m a little iffy on the yellow, of course, but green and blue are two of my most favorite colors. Haha, guess my third, if you can. I love it. Even the little ''shine'' at the top right just looks like it belongs there.', '2008-04-15 00:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4640065, 661684, 39427, '<td valign="top">great slice of life, you''re very good at racking up those favorites!</td>', 'great slice of life, you''re very good at racking up those favorites!', '2008-04-15 01:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4641613, 661587, 5034, '<td valign="top">Angela, nice photo, I love our red dirt and red rocks up north, as has been said, you really needed to make use of the full size allowed here.  But it''s excellent to see you having a go, don''t let the low score and place discourage you, take the advice you''ve been given and do a better one next time, that''s how you grow here.  That''s how I grew here.</td>', 'Angela, nice photo, I love our red dirt and red rocks up north, as has been said, you really needed to make use of the full size allowed here.  But it''s excellent to see you having a go, don''t let the low score and place discourage you, take the advice you''ve been given and do a better one next time, that''s how you grow here.  That''s how I grew here.', '2008-04-15 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4648845, 661961, 91679, '<td valign="top">Yet another overly dark snap shot</td>', 'Yet another overly dark snap shot', '2008-04-19 14:01:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4650479, 662183, 67841, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon - this was nicely done...</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon - this was nicely done...', '2008-04-20 23:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4658087, 662214, 4226, '<td valign="top">Hello :)<br/> <br/>In this picture, I feel the red wall in front over-powers the stair pattern. My eyes are constantly drawn towards the left top of the frame which doesn''t have much to add to the pic. Also a lot of variation of light from left to right which also hinders focussing on the lines which the photograph is about.</td>', 'Hello :) In this picture, I feel the red wall in front over-powers the stair pattern. My eyes are constantly drawn towards the left top of the frame which doesn''t have much to add to the pic. Also a lot of variation of light from left to right which also hinders focussing on the lines which the photograph is about.', '2008-04-24 22:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662581, 661945, 48228, '<td valign="top">This was so underrated and should have scored much higher..... I love the bright colors very much.....We finished next to each other, so that was nice.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-28 09:26:36.</i></td>', 'This was so underrated and should have scored much higher..... I love the bright colors very much.....We finished next to each other, so that was nice.....', '2008-04-28 10:25:54.000000', '2008-04-28 10:26:36.000000', 0),
(4717229, 661920, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really like this one when I saw it, as I love the patterns, strong colors, lines, and geometric feeling about it.....</td>', 'I really like this one when I saw it, as I love the patterns, strong colors, lines, and geometric feeling about it.....', '2008-05-22 10:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4718548, 661575, 48228, '<td valign="top">I can see natures patterns very clearly in this image. I love the clouds and the sky very much. <br/> <br/>Maybe a little over saturated for most of the DPV voters, but I do that, as I like color, and often I get scored down, due to that<br/> <br/>Also the textures and patterns on the hill , but feel their is a little to much foreground here, and distracts one from the other areas in this image. Maybe cropping some of the foreground, would have added more appeal to this image. Visually take away part of the bottom area, and a little from the right side, and see the difference it would make. <br/> <br/>Again, I hope this helps you, as it is a very appealing landscape with some interesting patterns.</td>', 'I can see natures patterns very clearly in this image. I love the clouds and the sky very much.  Maybe a little over saturated for most of the DPV voters, but I do that, as I like color, and often I get scored down, due to that Also the textures and patterns on the hill , but feel their is a little to much foreground here, and distracts one from the other areas in this image. Maybe cropping some of the foreground, would have added more appeal to this image. Visually take away part of the bottom area, and a little from the right side, and see the difference it would make.  Again, I hope this helps you, as it is a very appealing landscape with some interesting patterns.', '2008-05-22 23:32:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4726609, 661821, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good patterns entry. I''m surprised no-one''s mentioned that your colours are flat and it could do with a wee bit more sharpening.</td>', 'Good patterns entry. I''m surprised no-one''s mentioned that your colours are flat and it could do with a wee bit more sharpening.', '2008-05-27 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4756470, 661639, 44877, '<td valign="top">So stunning! Love the dynamic lines and the minimalistic composition - really brilliant. I''m glad it was acknowledged via the score. You  never know with such shots.</td>', 'So stunning! Love the dynamic lines and the minimalistic composition - really brilliant. I''m glad it was acknowledged via the score. You  never know with such shots.', '2008-06-07 19:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4766209, 660681, 30807, '<td valign="top">I wondered what on earth it was - why put these on glass windows - then it crossed my mind that in Singapore, with such hot light, that maybe they are shading the inside of the building during hot weather or extreme light, otherwise why bother?<br/>Any comments about that?<br/>I like this picture a lot - well done</td>', 'I wondered what on earth it was - why put these on glass windows - then it crossed my mind that in Singapore, with such hot light, that maybe they are shading the inside of the building during hot weather or extreme light, otherwise why bother?Any comments about that?I like this picture a lot - well done', '2008-06-12 15:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
