(4782345, 661684, 76335, '<td valign="top">I never got back around to commenting on this, but I love it! I would have scored this high. Lots of eye candy and patterns and geometry. It is busy, and as you suspected, you''re offering up a lot for the DPC voter to scrutinize. Keep doing what you''re doing though -- this is good stuff.</td>', 'I never got back around to commenting on this, but I love it! I would have scored this high. Lots of eye candy and patterns and geometry. It is busy, and as you suspected, you''re offering up a lot for the DPC voter to scrutinize. Keep doing what you''re doing though -- this is good stuff.', '2008-06-23 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
